triageContextSet event wiring\n\nPhase 1 - Remove all DEMO_* hardcoded fallbacks:\n- CodingQueue.tsx: show fetchError Alert on API failure\n- PriorAuthTracker.tsx: show fetchError Alert on API failure\n- DenialManager.tsx: show fetchError Alert on API failure\n- RiskPanel.tsx: empty state on error (no DEMO_RISKS)\n- CareGapList.tsx: loading spinner + fetchError Alert added\n- ClinicalAlertsCenter.tsx: empty arrays on all failure paths\n\nPhase 2 - Clinical workflow cross-MFE wiring:\n- mfe-events: add TriageContextSetDetail, TRIAGE_CONTEXT_SET,\n  emitTriageContextSet, onTriageContextSet\n- VoiceSessionController: emit triageContextSet before navigating\n  to /triage so TriageViewer pre-populates immediately\n- TriageViewer: subscribe to onTriageContextSet, call persistWorkflow\n  + integrateWorkflow on receipt\n\nDocs: add docs/roadmap/next-phases-implementation-plan.md (8 phases)","tree":{"sha":"2bba8f0381dccee6ee530c33174b08139d9ad461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/2bba8f0381dccee6ee530c33174b08139d9ad461"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/1b74f48bc5d7d883d64dcbf5c48d3771c5080d43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site