\nscheduling-mfe:\n- workflowSync: add AuthFetch type + thread authFetch param through postWorkflowTransition,\n  syncWorkflowReserve, syncWorkflowBooked, syncWorkflowWaitlist\n- SlotCalendar: pass authFetch to syncWorkflowReserve\n- WaitlistPanel: pass authFetch to both syncWorkflowWaitlist calls\n- BookingForm: add useAuthFetch, pass to syncWorkflowBooked\n\nGateway:\n- Add /graphql -> bff-service YARP route (appsettings.json + cluster definition)\n- Add bff-service ACA internal URL to appsettings.Production.json\n\nCI/CD:\n- Add bff to detect-changes filter, outputs, matrix, post-deploy smoke condition,\n  and validate-dispatch-inputs allowed values in microservice-deploy.yml\n\nType-checks: engagement-mfe tsc --noEmit clean, scheduling-mfe tsc --noEmit clean","tree":{"sha":"7af908918acad593d662d54c32daf0d7dfe98b70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/7af908918acad593d662d54c32daf0d7dfe98b70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/25fb1465fefb92e8b2f5e7cad24e69350924fbca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap