Go-Live KPI gate endpoint URLs with the same override model.\n- Add engagement MFE URL support to Go-Live Lighthouse gate so coverage\n  aligns with all deployed MFEs.\n- Add new release-readiness-orchestrator workflow to compute a single\n  go/no-go signal for dev, staging, and production using latest main-branch\n  workflow outcomes with freshness checks.\n- Optional triage issue creation when readiness fails.\n- Update workflow catalog with orchestrator entry and URL variable\n  conventions used by cloud validation workflows.","tree":{"sha":"b5d5131a7a1b98208bc8cdf4c245d03711e9c8d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/b5d5131a7a1b98208bc8cdf4c245d03711e9c8d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/c1bb7d57afc478876a85689fd55e0f4597a27193","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/c1bb7d57afc478876a85689fd55e0f4597a27193","node_id":"C_kwDOR8DpatoAKGMxYmI3ZDU3YWZjNDc4ODc2YTg1Njg5ZmQ1NWUwZjQ1OTdhMjcxOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/086a69cbb393933298d7beaa9224e413a2056a92","sha":"086a69cbb393933298d7beaa9224e413a2056a92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/086a69cbb393933298d7beaa9224e413a2056a92"}],"sha":"c1bb7d57afc478876a85689fd55e0f4597a27193","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/c1bb7d57afc478876a85689fd55e0f4597a27193"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/086a69cbb393933298d7beaa9224e413a2056a92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T23:50:31Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T05:23:42Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"feat: Phase 39 — BFF typed HTTP client tests + QueryType dashboard aggregation tests\n\nAdd ProjectReference to HealthQCopilot.BFF in the unit test project.\nAdd 21 unit tests across two new files covering the BFF layer:\n\nDownstreamApiClientTests (18 tests):\n\nFakeHttpHandler + FakeClient<T> helpers intercept HttpClient in-process\nwith no network I/O; LastRequest property enables URL-assertion tests.\n\nPopHealthApiClientTests (5 tests):\n- GetRisksAsync: deserializes risk list from JSON\n- GetRisksAsync: returns empty list when response is JSON null\n- GetRiskByPatientAsync: request URL contains patient ID\n- GetStatsAsync: deserializes PopHealthStatsDto fields\n- ScoreSdohAsync: uses POST method and targets /sdoh endpoint\n\nAgentApiClientTests (2 tests):\n- GetTriageSessionsAsync: deserializes session list\n- GetStatsAsync: swallows JsonException and returns AgentStatsDto(0,0,0)\n\nRevenueApiClientTests (2 tests):\n- GetCodingJobsAsync: deserializes coding job list\n- GetStatsAsync: swallows JsonException and returns RevenueStatsDto(0,0)\n\nSchedulingApiClientTests (2 tests):\n- GetAppointmentsAsync: deserializes appointment list\n- GetStatsAsync: swallows JsonException and returns SchedulingStatsDto(0,0)\n\nFhirApiClientTests (3 tests):\n- GetEncountersAsync(null): hits /api/v1/fhir/encounters with no query string\n- GetEncountersAsync(''p''): appends ?patientId= query parameter\n- GetEncountersAsync: deserializes EncounterDto list\n\nVoiceApiClientTests (3 tests):\n- GetSessionsAsync(null): hits /api/v1/voice/sessions with no query string\n- GetSessionsAsync(''p''): appends ?patientId= query parameter\n- GetSoapNoteAsync: request URL contains session ID; deserializes SoapNoteDto\n\nQueryTypeDashboardTests (3 tests):\n\nQueryType is instantiated directly (no IoC required; all deps injected as parameters).\n\n- GetDashboardStatsAsync: aggregates Agents + Scheduling + PopHealth + Revenue correctly\n- GetDashboardStatsAsync: when PopHealth returns JSON null falls back to PopHealthStatsDto(0,0,0,0)\n- GetDashboardStatsAsync: all four services are called (Task.WhenAll fan-out verified via\n  thread-safe call log in the fake handlers)\n\nTests: 475 passed (was 454), 0 failed","tree":{"sha":"014693f474ae56334a6a75b346d429e704de361d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/014693f474ae56334a6a75b346d429e704de361d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/086a69cbb393933298d7beaa9224e413a2056a92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/086a69cbb393933298d7beaa9224e413a2056a92","node_id":"C_kwDOR8DpatoAKDA4NmE2OWNiYjM5MzkzMzI5OGQ3YmVhYTkyMjRlNDEzYTIwNTZhOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/4d96ecc588d51c9b225e56f847bd851c5f75694f","sha":"4d96ecc588d51c9b225e56f847bd851c5f75694f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/4d96ecc588d51c9b225e56f847bd851c5f75694f"}],"sha":"086a69cbb393933298d7beaa9224e413a2056a92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/086a69cbb393933298d7beaa9224e413a2056a92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/4d96ecc588d51c9b225e56f847bd851c5f75694f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T22:43:44Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T05:23:42Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"feat: Phase 38 — unit tests for PhiAuditMiddleware (HIPAA audit control)\n\nAdd 11 unit tests covering all testable behaviours of PhiAuditMiddleware:\n\nNon-PHI path tests (2 tests):\n- Non-PHI paths pass straight through: next() is called, logger is never invoked\n- Non-PHI paths never publish to Event Hubs (IEventHubAuditService not called)\n\nPHI path tests (9 tests):\n- next() is always called for PHI paths (audit never blocks the response)\n- Logger receives exactly 2 Information calls: PHI_ACCESS (before next) + PHI_ACCESS_COMPLETE (after next)\n- Path matching is case-insensitive (/API/V1/PATIENTS treated as PHI)\n- User ID extracted from oid JWT claim and persisted to audit log\n- Falls back to ''anonymous'' when no oid claim is present\n- Audit entry persisted to AuditDbContext with correct userId, method, and path\n- IEventHubAuditService.PublishAsync called exactly once for PHI path when present\n- Works without IEventHubAuditService (null optional dependency)\n- Persistence exception is swallowed and logged at Error level; response completes normally\n\nTest infrastructure:\n- Uses EFCore InMemory provider (already in test project) with unique DB names per test\n- Fire-and-forget PersistAuditEntryAsync verified by opening a second AuditDbContext\n  pointing to the same InMemory database name after a 150 ms yield\n- Broken IServiceScopeFactory (Returns throws InvalidOperationException) validates\n  exception swallowing path without needing to subclass AuditDbContext\n\nTests: 454 passed (was 443), 0 failed","tree":{"sha":"a2fd16a45ee935617b02e6419291c0ae121a3fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/a2fd16a45ee935617b02e6419291c0ae121a3fad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/4d96ecc588d51c9b225e56f847bd851c5f75694f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/4d96ecc588d51c9b225e56f847bd851c5f75694f","node_id":"C_kwDOR8DpatoAKDRkOTZlY2M1ODhkNTFjOWIyMjVlNTZmODQ3YmQ4NTFjNWY3NTY5NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/a9f4ee4c8c2b4a4bed41f34fd5e509afe81b7a0c","sha":"a9f4ee4c8c2b4a4bed41f34fd5e509afe81b7a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/a9f4ee4c8c2b4a4bed41f34fd5e509afe81b7a0c"}],"sha":"4d96ecc588d51c9b225e56f847bd851c5f75694f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/4d96ecc588d51c9b225e56f847bd851c5f75694f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/a9f4ee4c8c2b4a4bed41f34fd5e509afe81b7a0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T22:22:27Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T05:23:42Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"feat: Phase 37 — unit tests for SecurityHeadersMiddleware, IdempotencyMiddleware, and RateLimitingExtensions\n\nAdd InternalsVisibleTo for HealthQCopilot.Tests.Unit to expose ResolveTier.\nAdd 25 unit tests covering three untested middleware components:\n\nSecurityHeadersMiddlewareTests (7 tests):\n- All 7 OWASP security headers are set on every response\n- X-Content-Type-Options is nosniff\n- X-Frame-Options is DENY\n- Content-Security-Policy forbids frame-ancestors\n- Strict-Transport-Security has max-age and includeSubDomains\n- next() is always invoked\n- Headers are set before next() is called (downstream middleware can read them)\n\nIdempotencyMiddlewareTests (8 tests):\n- GET requests bypass idempotency check entirely\n- POST to non-protected paths bypasses idempotency check\n- POST without X-Idempotency-Key header bypasses idempotency check\n- Cache hit returns cached response without calling next()\n- Cache miss on 2xx response stores response in distributed cache\n- Cache miss on 4xx response does NOT store in cache (client must retry)\n- On cache miss next() is always invoked\n- Different paths produce distinct cache keys (cross-endpoint replay prevention)\n\nRateLimitingExtensionsTierTests (10 tests, incl. 4 Theory cases):\n- No header/claim returns Sandbox tier (null-safe, no NPE)\n- Unknown X-Tenant-Id header resolves to Sandbox tier\n- Unknown JWT tid claim resolves to Sandbox tier\n- Both header and JWT present resolves without exception (header priority)\n- TenantTier enum values match documented req/min budgets (Clinical=1000, Revenue=500, Engagement=200, Sandbox=100)\n- Empty X-Tenant-Id header falls back to Sandbox\n- Whitespace-only X-Tenant-Id header falls back to Sandbox\n\nTests: 443 passed (was 418), 0 failed","tree":{"sha":"880ca4c87f4605058ab0f5f302ab4cf8add96801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/880ca4c87f4605058ab0f5f302ab4cf8add96801"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/a9f4ee4c8c2b4a4bed41f34fd5e509afe81b7a0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/a9f4ee4c8c2b4a4bed41f34fd5e509afe81b7a0c","node_id":"C_kwDOR8DpatoAKGE5ZjRlZTRjOGMyYjRhNGJlZDQxZjM0ZmQ1ZTUwOWFmZTgxYjdhMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/587a487550fd7591512078df55206c2b0586c177","sha":"587a487550fd7591512078df55206c2b0586c177","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/587a487550fd7591512078df55206c2b0586c177"}],"sha":"a9f4ee4c8c2b4a4bed41f34fd5e509afe81b7a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/a9f4ee4c8c2b4a4bed41f34fd5e509afe81b7a0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/587a487550fd7591512078df55206c2b0586c177/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T22:13:02Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T05:23:42Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"feat: Phase 36 — unit tests for StartupValidationService and TenantContextMiddleware\n\nAdd 21 unit tests covering two untested infrastructure cross-cutting components:\n\nStartupValidationServiceTests (11 tests):\n- ValidConfig passes with any one of the 12 supported DB connection string keys\n- Missing all DB connection strings throws InvalidOperationException\n- AzureOpenAI endpoint set without DeploymentName fails validation\n- AzureOpenAI endpoint + DeploymentName together passes\n- Invalid AppConfig:Endpoint URI (non-absolute) fails validation\n- Valid absolute AppConfig:Endpoint URI passes\n- Non-Development environment with DAPR_HTTP_PORT unset fails (env var save/restore)\n- Development environment skips Dapr check even without DAPR_HTTP_PORT\n- Multiple errors (missing DB + invalid URI) reported with correct count (2) in message\n- StopAsync always completes without throwing\n\nTenantContextMiddlewareTests (10 tests):\n- X-Tenant-Id header takes priority over JWT tid claim\n- JWT tid claim used when no X-Tenant-Id header present\n- No tenant header or claim falls back to ''unknown''\n- JWT sub claim sets UserId\n- JWT oid claim used when sub is absent\n- No user claims falls back to ''anonymous''\n- patientId route value sets PatientId\n- X-Patient-Id header used when no route value present\n- No patient info falls back to ''-''\n- next() delegate is always invoked regardless of header values\n\nTests: 418 passed (was 397), 0 failed","tree":{"sha":"adb0065833a468644bd0fa3aed0b437a358af9a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/adb0065833a468644bd0fa3aed0b437a358af9a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/587a487550fd7591512078df55206c2b0586c177","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://