:\n- release-gate-policy.json: add security-scorecard.yml to\n  recommendedPostMergeChecks; the Release Gate Policy Audit now verifies\n  a successful security scorecard run within the 14-day success window\n  alongside cloud-e2e-tests and gateway-route-probes\n- environment-promotion.yml (production gate): wire security-scorecard.yml\n  into the production gate''s Promise.all alongside release-gate-policy-audit,\n  dora-metrics, and weekly-platform-scorecard; production promotion is now\n  blocked when security-scorecard has not passed recently on main\n- platform-gap-backlog-2026-04-25.md: mark P1 Node 20 deprecation item\n  resolved — zero node-version: 20 references exist in any workflow\n  (all on 22); dependency-freshness.yml enforces the pattern in the\n  environment-promotion dev gate on every PR touching workflows\n- platform-next-phases-2026-04-26.md: Phase 16 defined with goal,\n  status, key work, and exit criteria","tree":{"sha":"b7b6e176d0919139b48f1c8fdec3e38b4a6dea75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/b7b6e176d0919139b48f1c8fdec3e38b4a6dea75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/5a9da4df51212e316b3b750f69244bb6a2c2359a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"http