f35860827de1b727ded75ee2fabef3137f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T06:46:35Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T05:23:41Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"feat: Platform Next Phase 15 — frontend deploy evidence enforcement\n\nClose P1 gap: workflow_run gating treated Frontend MFE CI/CD deploy\nevidence as entirely optional, allowing Cloud E2E to pass against\nstale or broken SWA builds when a frontend-triggered run failed to\ndeploy.\n\nChanges:\n- cloud-e2e-tests.yml deployment-sync gate: make Frontend MFE CI/CD\n  required when it is the triggering workflow (dynamic optionalIfMissing\n  keyed on context.payload.workflow_run.name); remains optional when\n  triggered by Microservice CI/CD, schedule, or manual dispatch.\n- cloud-e2e-tests.yml: add build-and-deploy job-level inspection for\n  frontend deploy evidence, mirroring the post-deploy-smoke job check\n  used for backend. Three outcomes:\n    ready         — build-and-deploy succeeded (SWA deployed)\n    not-deployed  — build-and-deploy skipped (no MFE changes in push)\n    failed        — build-and-deploy failed (gate blocks with hardFailure)\n- platform-next-phases-2026-04-26.md: Phase 15 defined with goal,\n  status, key work, and exit criteria.\n- platform-gap-backlog-2026-04-25.md: P1 workflow_run gating item\n  marked resolved with Phase 15 reference.","tree":{"sha":"7434d9491f075b0e9ea816c7af587c68f6acab04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/7434d9491f075b0e9ea816c7af587c68f6acab04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/2e88ef35860827de1b727ded75ee2fabef3137f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.