":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/b0281680772508c46cead15be2cb7ef8a8e55875/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T06:37:37Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T05:23:41Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"feat: Phase 10+11 — wire cost-governance and dependency-freshness into promotion gates\n\nPhase 11 — Dependency Freshness (Key Work):\n- Add dependency-freshness.yml to the environment-promotion dev gate;\n  the gate now evaluates 4 required checks: Cloud E2E Tests, Workflow\n  Lint, Gateway Route Probes, and Dependency Freshness before granting\n  a dev-promotion token\n\nPhase 10 — Cost Governance (Key Work):\n- Wire cost-governance.yml into the environment-promotion staging gate;\n  the staging gate now evaluates 5 required checks: Runtime Convergence\n  Audit, Compliance and Security Checks, Cloud E2E Regression, Rollback\n  Drill Readiness, and Cost Governance before surfacing a production-\n  promotion approval request\n\nAll Phase 11 exit criteria now satisfied:\n- dependency-freshness.yml scans for floating pins, stale major versions,\n  and deprecated Node runtime references\n- No node-version: 20 references in any workflow (all on 22)\n- No floating mutable-branch action pins (@main/@master/@latest)\n- All GitHub-owned actions on latest known major versions (v4/v7)\n- Dependency freshness in the environment promotion dev gate","tree":{"sha":"81b