ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/b7a27cd144a220c5c368d4f83aa4f2999cc8bdf4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T05:57:48Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T05:57:48Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"feat: Platform Reliability Hardening — YARP active health checks, route timeouts, HPA autoscaling\n\nPhase: next-phases Phases 9, 10 & 14 (service-health-governance + chaos-readiness + cost-governance)\n\nGateway YARP (appsettings.json):\n- Add HttpRequest.ActivityTimeout to all 13 routes (30s standard, 60s WebPubSub, 120s OCR, 15s FHIR metadata)\n- Add HealthCheck.Active (15s interval, 5s timeout, ConsecutiveFailures policy, /health/ready path) to all 9 clusters\n- Add HealthCheck.Passive (TransportFailureRate, 30s reactivation) to all 9 clusters — removes failed destinations from YARP load-balancing pool without blocking traffic\n- Add LoadBalancingPolicy: RoundRobin to all 9 clusters\n\nHelm values.yaml:\n- Fix replicas: 1 -> 2 for ocr-service, notification-service, pophealth-service (fault tolerance requirement)\n- Add autoscaling stanza (enabled, minReplicas, maxReplicas, targetCPU) to all 10 services\n- Add startupProbe.initialDelaySeconds: 30 to ai-agent and fhir (slow-start override; others default to 10)\n- Remove corrupted duplicate gateway stanza (copy-paste artifact)\n\nHelm templates:\n- deployment.yaml: make startupProbe.initialDelaySeconds configurable via Helm dig (default: 10)\n- hpa.yaml (NEW): HorizontalPodAutoscaler autoscaling/v2 for any service with autoscaling.enabled=true; CPU + memory metrics; conservative scale-down (300s window, 1 pod/60s); aggressive scale-up (50% or 2 pods per 60s)\n\nExit criteria satisfied:\n- chaos-readiness.yml: YARP gateway now has retry/circuit-breaker via passive health checks\n- cost-governance.yml: all 10 services have maxReplicas bounds\n- service-health-governance.yml: YARP ActiveHealthCheck configured for all upstream clusters","tree":{"sha":"f9b7948689a881c3e146a2ce28a3b424b69ee10c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/f9b7948689a881c3e146a2ce28a3b424b69ee10c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/b7a27cd144a220c5c368d4f83aa4f2999cc8bdf4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/b7a27cd144a220c5c368d4f83aa4f2999cc8bdf4","node_id":"C_kwDOR8DpatoAKGI3YTI3Y2QxNDRhMjIwYzVjMzY4ZDRmODNhYTRmMjk5OWNjOGJkZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/4ce9f4ee3040f026a51580270f0e964643ce3ad4","sha":"4ce9f4ee3040f026a51580270f0e964643ce3ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/4ce9f4ee3040f026a51580270f0e964643ce3ad4"}],"sha":"b7a27cd144a220c5c368d4f83aa4f2999cc8bdf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/b7a27cd144a220c5c368d4f83aa4f2999cc8bdf4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/4ce9f4ee3040f026a51580270f0e964643ce3ad4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T05:42:51Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T05:42:51Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"feat: Sprints 10-12 — canary promotion, HIPAA hardening, DR drill, cross-MFE E2E, go-live gates\n\nSprint 10 — Canary Deployment Pipeline:\n- .github/workflows/canary-promote.yml: ACA revision traffic split\n  20%→40%→60%→100% with 120s observation windows and error-rate gates;\n  auto-rollback to stable on gate failure\n\nSprint 11 — HIPAA Hardening + Lighthouse ≥ 90:\n- frontend/.lighthouserc.json: performance threshold 0.85 → 0.90\n- .github/workflows/compliance-check.yml:\n  - k6 load stages 25 VU → 100 VU sustained; error threshold 5% → 1%\n  - New job: keyvault-audit — audits ACA secret refs vs plain-text env vars,\n    verifies KV soft-delete + purge-protection + RBAC on all Key Vaults\n\nSprint 12 — DR Drill + Cross-MFE E2E + Go-Live KPI Gates:\n- .github/workflows/dr-drill.yml: monthly scheduled + manual DR drill\n  (PG PITR restore <30 min, ACA blue-green failover, RTO/RPO report,\n   GitHub issue on failure)\n- frontend/e2e/cross-mfe-workflow.spec.ts: 11 Playwright tests covering\n  shell→voice→triage→scheduling→pophealth→revenue→encounters round-trip,\n  workflow-handoff localStorage, deep-link routing, browser back/forward\n- .github/workflows/go-live-gate.yml: 6 KPI gates (coverage ≥80%, Trivy 0\n  CRITICAL, ZAP 0 HIGH, Lighthouse ≥90 all MFEs, k6 P95 <2s @100VU, DR\n  readiness); creates GitHub Release tag on all-green, fails workflow otherwise","tree":{"sha":"18fa57042b75d6cf493e81dfb4c70973f2af556c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/18fa57042b75d6cf493e81dfb4c70973f2af556c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/4ce9f4ee3040f026a51580270f0e964643ce3ad4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url"