or, RegexPhiRedactor)\n- Data-residency health check (AzureOpenAIRegionHealthCheck)\n- HIPAA guardrail prompts v1.1 (non-definitive-diagnosis prefix)\n- Audit chain-of-custody: AgentDecision + WorkflowDispatched + ConsentDecision\n- Patient consent gate (IConsentService / DefaultConsentService)\n- Dedicated ConsentDecision audit factory + redactionEntityCount on AgentDecision\n\nW2 Multi-Agent Orchestration\n- AgentHandoffCoordinator with agent_handoff_depth Histogram<int>\n- CriticAgent (cross-agent groundedness reviewer) wired into TriageOrchestrator\n- Tool RBAC enforcement (ToolPolicyFilter, agent_tool_rbac_denied_total)\n- Episodic memory integration into AgentPlanningLoop\n- Loop budget enforcement (AgentBudgetTracker, partial-result on exhaustion)\n- Session cancel: AgentSessionCancellationRegistry + cancel endpoint\n\nW3 Evaluation & Quality\n- ClinicalEvaluator + triage.json golden set (3 cases)\n- LLM-as-judge groundedness scorer\n- Azure Content Safety toxicity screener\n- Clinician feedback telemetry (agent_feedback_total)\n- CI eval gate (agent-eval.yml, Category=Eval trait)\n- Hallucination dashboard (agent-quality.json, 9 panels)\n\nW4 Observability, Cost, Prompt Registry\n- Cosmos token ledger (CosmosTokenLedger, 30d TTL)\n- Cost attribution: agent_llm_cost_usd_total counter + agent-cost.json dashboard\n- Planning-loop latency SLO histogram (agent_planning_loop_ms)\n- Trace export API (GET /api/v1/agents/traces/{sessionId})\n- InMemoryPromptRegistry + CosmosAgentPromptRegistry decorator\n- Model/prompt version tagging on every audit/trace record\n\nP3 Integration & Hardening\n- AgentJourneyEndToEndTests (7 E2E facts, WebApplicationFactory)\n- k6 agent planning-loop load test script (50 RPS, p99 < 5s)\n- PHI egress verification runbook\n- HIPAA Agentic-AI Evidence Pack v1.0\n- ai-engineers.md agentic-AI patterns section\n\nP4 Production Rollout Prep\n- Argo AnalysisTemplate agent-quality-gate (5 metrics, 30-min soak)\n- P4.1/P4.2/P4.3 canary rollout runbooks\n- PrometheusRule agent.cost group (4 budget/spike alerts)\n- PrometheusRule agent.eval_critic group (AgentEvalPassRateLow + critic rejection alerts)\n- Presidio ACA bicep module\n\nUnit suite: 350/350 green","tree":{"sha":"6a3a1d4467bef7393fce58eb25294b175ac010e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/6a3a1d4467bef7393fce58eb25294b175ac010e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/33b8030c2e19d66efef60f4d623eb01b65e7e835","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/33b8030c2e19d66efef60f4d623eb01b65e7e835","node_id":"C_kwDOR8DpatoAKDMzYjgwMzBjMmUxOWQ2NmVmZWY2MGY0ZDYyM2ViMDFiNjVlN2U4MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/3d31be7a6d91ddf01822a4754072f895f7fc7324","sha":"3d31be7a6d91ddf01822a4754072f895f7fc7324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-