l/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/edab9fd4a91673ce7a36d6bd5c21c3b6320c1853/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T00:38:54Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T00:38:54Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"ci: Phase 9-11 — chaos readiness, cost governance, dependency freshness\n\nPhase 9: chaos-readiness.yml\n- Renders Helm chart and audits values.yaml for resource requests/limits on\n  all 10 services (voice, ai-agent, fhir, identity, ocr, scheduling,\n  notification, pop-health, revenue, gateway)\n- Audits Helm Deployment/StatefulSet templates for readinessProbe and\n  livenessProbe definitions\n- Validates gateway YARP config for retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker policies\n- Alerts on replicas < 2 (no redundancy) and replicas < 1 (service would not run)\n- Fails when any gap found; uploads chaos-readiness-<date> artifact (60-day)\n- Triggers: Tuesday 07:00 UTC schedule + PR on infra/helm/** + workflow_dispatch\n\nPhase 10: cost-governance.yml\n- Audits all 10 service resource requests and limits against approved thresholds:\n  CPU limit <= 4 cores, memory limit <= 8 GiB, maxReplicas <= 20\n- Detects request > limit misconfigurations (Kubernetes pod OOM/eviction risk)\n- Fails when budget gaps found; uploads cost-governance-<date> artifact (90-day)\n- Triggers: Wednesday 07:00 UTC schedule + PR on infra/helm/values*.yaml\n\nPhase 11: dependency-freshness.yml\n- Scans all .github/workflows/*.yml for floating mutable-branch pins (@main,\n  @master, @latest) — HIGH risk supply-chain signal; fails workflow\n- Reports stale major versions via KNOWN_LATEST manifest for 22 actions\n- Detects deprecated node-version: 20 references (enforcement Q3 2026)\n- Stale versions and node warnings are surfaced but non-blocking\n- Uploads dependency-freshness-<date> artifact (90-day retention)\n- Triggers: Thursday 07:00 UTC schedule + PR on .github/workflows/**\n\nweekly-platform-scorecard.yml: wire chaos-readiness, cost-governance,\ndependency-freshness into workflow list and KPI snapshot\n\nAll workflows validated actionlint-clean.","tree":{"sha":"7b7d0cda6b9893c8ed970e4d98fcdc6211095071","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/7b7d0cda6b9893c8ed970e4d98fcdc6211095071"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/edab9fd4a91673ce7a36d6bd5c21c3b6320c1853","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"html