 6-8 — environment promotion, SLO error budget, security scorecard\n\nPhase 6: environment-promotion.yml\n- Dev gate: cloud-e2e, workflow-lint, pr-validation, helm-chart-validation,\n  gateway-route-probes all green on main required before staging promotion\n- Staging gate: runtime-convergence-audit, compliance-check,\n  cloud-e2e-regression, rollback-drill-readiness required before production\n- Production gate: release-gate-policy-audit, dora-metrics, weekly-platform-scorecard;\n  requires GitHub Environment ''production-promotion'' with required reviewers\n- Triggers: push to main (dev gate auto) + workflow_dispatch for all stages\n\nPhase 7: slo-error-budget.yml\n- SLI sources: cloud-e2e-tests.yml + gateway-route-probes.yml (good = success)\n- 28-day rolling window (configurable), SLO target 99.5% (configurable)\n- Error budget computed as events, alert threshold 20% remaining\n- Fails workflow when budget critically low so scorecard captures breach signal\n- Uploads slo-error-budget-<date> artifact (90-day retention)\n- Schedule: Monday 09:00 UTC\n\nPhase 8: security-scorecard.yml\n- OpenSSF Scorecard v2.4.0 — supply-chain hygiene (branch protection,\n  dependency update, token permissions, signed releases etc.)\n- SARIF uploaded to GitHub Security tab + artifact retained 90 days\n- CodeQL SAST matrix: csharp + javascript-typescript, security-and-quality queries\n- C# builds with dotnet 10, JS/TS uses auto-build\n- Schedule: Monday 06:00 UTC + push to main + workflow_dispatch\n\nweekly-platform-scorecard.yml: wire slo-error-budget, security-scorecard,\nenvironment-promotion into workflow list and KPI snapshot\n\ndocs/stakeholders/platform-next-phases-2026-04-26.md: add phases 6-8 with\nexit criteria and ownership model\n\nAll four workflows validated actionlint-clean.","tree":{"sha":"e97e5dfdf803cc47720e2b429e9dc1125cd5e2d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/e97e5dfdf803cc47720e2b429e9dc1125cd5e2d9"},"url":"https:/