/api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/13a9486e37c31958daedfacc17cf3a4ceece8821/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:58:29Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:58:29Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"ci: dependency-review, DORA metrics, SWA deploy evidence, scorecard DORA KPI\n\n- pr-validation.yml: add dependency-review job using actions/dependency-review-action@v4\n  - fails on severity >= high, posts PR comment summary\n  - denies GPL-2.0, GPL-3.0, AGPL-3.0 licenses\n  - guarded to pull_request events only\n\n- dora-metrics.yml: new workflow — four DORA key metrics\n  - deployment frequency: successful microservice-deploy + frontend-deploy runs/week\n  - lead time for changes: median PR merge to first successful deploy (minutes)\n  - change failure rate: rollback runs / deploy runs (%)\n  - MTTR: average successful rollback run duration (minutes)\n  - publishes job summary + dora-metrics-<date> artifact (90-day retention)\n  - runs weekly Monday 08:30 UTC + workflow_dispatch with configurable window\n\n- frontend-deploy.yml: SWA build evidence artifact after each successful deploy\n  - generates deploy-evidence.md with app, SHA, run URL, timestamp, gate checklist\n  - uploads swa-deploy-evidence-<app>-<sha> artifact (30-day retention)\n  - guarded to same condition as deploy step\n  - also fixes pre-existing SC2086 (unquoted GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY redirect)\n\n- weekly-platform-scorecard.yml: wire dora-metrics.yml into workflow list + KPI snapshot\n  - adds DORA metrics pass trend to KPI section\n\n- rollback-drill-readiness.yml: add previously committed but untracked file\n\nAll workflows validated actionlint-clean.","tree":{"sha":"29adcd846c026b20fb7c43f92f3b67e225ec4747","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/29adcd846c026b20fb7c43f92f3b67e225ec4747"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/13a9486e37c31958daedfacc17cf3a4ceece8821","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/a