ic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/ea1fa765686d3e683612c9ee57dfcab498cebfe8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:44:55Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:44:55Z","email":"imatiqul@users.noreply.github.com","name":"imatiqul"},"message":"feat: add enforceable governance automation for all 5 roadmap phases\n\nPhase 1 - Runtime Convergence Audit:\n- Add .github/workflows/runtime-convergence-audit.yml\n  - Audits consecutive Cloud E2E success requirement (2 runs)\n  - Audits gateway route probe health window (7 days)\n  - Publishes markdown evidence artifact and job summary\n  - strict_mode input fails workflow when criteria unmet\n\nPhase 2 - Release Gate Policy Audit:\n- Add .github/release-gate-policy.json (machine-readable required checks)\n- Add .github/workflows/release-gate-policy-audit.yml\n  - Reads policy JSON and inspects branch protection via GitHub API\n  - Surfaces missing required checks and post-merge gate health\n  - strict_mode input fails workflow on enforcement gaps\n\nPhase 3 - Evidence and Scorecards:\n- Add .github/workflows/gateway-route-probes.yml\n  - Dedicated route ownership probe workflow (deploy/schedule/manual)\n  - Fails on 404/405/502/503/504 from critical gateway paths\n- Extend weekly-platform-scorecard.yml with runtime convergence\n  and release gate policy audit trend metrics\n\nPhase 4 - Contract Governance:\n- Add .github/workflows/api-route-ownership-governance.yml\n  - PR-scoped enforcement: blocks gateway route changes without\n    ownership map update and route/cluster alignment checks\n\nPhase 5 - Operational Hardening:\n- Extend weekly-platform-scorecard.yml with rollback cadence,\n  MTTR, and route probe trend KPIs\n\nDocumentation:\n- Update .github/workflows/README.md with all new workflow entries\n- Update README.md pipeline index\n- Update devops-engineers.md, platform-managers.md, sre-operations.md\n- Update api-route-ownership-map.md, platform-next-phases-2026-04-26.md","tree":{"sha":"b2dda365af5bd07cab86b5f93bd8a7d11751af90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/trees/b2dda365af5bd07cab86b5f93bd8a7d11751af90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/git/commits/ea1fa765686d3e683612c9ee57dfcab498cebfe8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6357288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul","id":6357288,"login":"imatiqul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTcyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imatiqul","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/ea1fa765686d3e683612c9ee57dfcab498cebfe8","node_id":"C_kwDOR8DpatoAKGVhMWZhNzY1Njg2ZDNlNjgzNjEyYzllZTU3ZGZjYWI0OThjZWJmZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commit/62691fda8f6ef8deaa41e34af2c7a1e6d5673ca6","sha":"62691fda8f6ef8deaa41e34af2c7a1e6d5673ca6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imatiqul/azure-ai-cloud-healthcare/commits/62691fda8f6ef8deaa41e34af2c7a1e6d5673ca6"}],"sha":"ea1fa765686d3e683612c9ee57dfcab498c