:{"date":"2026-04-07T15:22:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: update deployment notes to reflect background eviction behavior (#25)\n\nReplace the blanket \"no eviction\" claim with accurate details about the\nbackground cleanup goroutines added in PR #14. Document what is evicted\n(expired rate limit windows, blocked brute-force entries after cooldown),\nwhat is not yet evicted (sub-threshold brute-force entries, tracked in\n#21), and the stop function for graceful shutdown.\n\nCloses #23","tree":{"sha":"a1dadf50388be22c31977a0ae75b0b69ee218447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/dorman/git/trees/a1dadf50388be22c31977a0ae75b0b69ee218447"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/dorman/git/commits/55c1b2b742dea50c3ecc897a3f3a09992a7b17e9","verification":{"payload":"tree a1dadf50388be22c31977a0ae75b0b69ee218447\nparent 3b73b8d20f293824b7028331d6771e9f8d57ae83\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775575342 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775575342 -0500\n\ndocs: update deployment notes to reflect background eviction behavior (#25)\n\nReplace the blanket \"no eviction\" claim with accurate details about the\nbackground cleanup goroutines added in PR #14. Document what is evicted\n(expired rate limit windows, blocked brute-force entries after cooldown),\nwhat is not yet evicted (sub-threshold brute-force entries, tracked in\n#21), and the stop function for graceful shutdown.\n\nCloses #23","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1SEuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcAIQAG8nmuesm2TXxF4/YTcGr6ib\noY8reP44FXmu8ZsHeQ4vAJ0ELYcJm8rFbyaRlIOXj34fAaXqJkyLGQsgVmJUtDaX\nG/WOLWJmTWtTe9pz267e43SvCDi9MLirqUBo4/Aj5xDznQqmEsr3YrjzMQmK66lj\n2tRjDOhILEbYCLq3wKQI/xt9Pzwk/RkZhsfzoObs8WlYZbkg+GGgjP83BldC3Azd\nPXV1nY6O9wwKiZsC+P6RpzWyE0bTqBoU4/N4YHmj6s0frWJp8o13odmekplvhpcb\nEW8Ljumkof5wZnsfSqVRj+jhXbluFHiiNqF4zMAbQ54vbh3+SLzEt+EL7KSTZS8J\nAVr0E1+/5f0+Uet0gwP0TvV9KkdmizD9VxP+hEuJNTJ