unt":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:56:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add fuzz tests for CSRF token parsing and validation (#18)\n\nAdd two Go native fuzz targets:\n- FuzzUnmaskToken_RoundTrip: obtains a valid masked token via GET, then\n  fuzzes mutations of the token string to verify unmaskToken never panics\n- FuzzCSRFMiddleware_PostToken: exercises the full POST validation path\n  with fuzzed token inputs through the public middleware API\n\nSeed corpus includes valid tokens, empty strings, odd-length strings,\ninvalid hex, truncated tokens, oversized inputs, and all-zero strings.\n\nCloses #9","tree":{"sha":"45fb7a0f726a6aef764dd7d8de3af117ec467074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/dorman/git/trees/45fb7a0f726a6aef764dd7d8de3af117ec467074"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/dorman/git/commits/472f317f584196b964831dd7750c4d446d61e173","verification":{"payload":"tree 45fb7a0f726a6aef764dd7d8de3af117ec467074\nparent c31917ce9f691148499b413aa706b0cd5fce6b36\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775573795 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775573795 -0500\n\ntest: add fuzz tests for CSRF token parsing and validation (#18)\n\nAdd two Go native fuzz targets:\n- FuzzUnmaskToken_RoundTrip: obtains a valid masked token via GET, then\n  fuzzes mutations of the token string to verify unmaskToken never panics\n- FuzzCSRFMiddleware_PostToken: exercises the full POST validation path\n  with fuzzed token inputs through the public middleware API\n\nSeed corpus includes valid tokens, empty strings, odd-length strings,\ninvalid hex, truncated tokens, oversized inputs, and all-zero strings.\n\nCloses #9","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1RsjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKWsQAIyvUTcCAGUm3odsNPNGti5B\npydyvuZH7y+/FHLvi8Ul/JY7vULHWQAlkmA2iQOL2zCiDRem3IzWDrTc1gknMgM0\nBkvPQW0TQnP+4HazLFfYkDU5MKvkLQNbj2kRl0bav8kHWBu94el9GSCV5lhdzGxJ\nItdzWWhaYJl01V6eOB+