efaults to Cooldown)\n\nCloses #2","tree":{"sha":"6a906885646be4f0e6eacceb5b414a1a3aa5560a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/dorman/git/trees/6a906885646be4f0e6eacceb5b414a1a3aa5560a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/dorman/git/commits/c31917ce9f691148499b413aa706b0cd5fce6b36","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a906885646be4f0e6eacceb5b414a1a3aa5560a\nparent 808f0de426a83720455b342359aa7c4c70697701\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775573791 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775573791 -0500\n\nfix: add background eviction to rate limit and brute force stores (#14)\n\nThe in-memory rateLimitStore and bruteForceStore maps never evicted\nstale keys, causing unbounded memory growth under sustained traffic.\n\nBoth stores now run a periodic cleanup goroutine that removes expired\nentries. RateLimit and BruteForceProtect return a stop function that\ncallers should defer to terminate the goroutine on shutdown.\n\nNew config fields:\n- RateLimitConfig.CleanupInterval (defaults to Window)\n- BruteForceConfig.CleanupInterval (defaults to Cooldown)\n\nCloses #2","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1RsfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWvUQAJvW2+FuXuJELroja6SQvgKg\nZxTRf/Se3jzbUJSxYoVCCF0bNEjzd/yUwaiEvAtMH5XcQmr2HH9/tyzc9aQmgFBT\nyOPfjqomkKmxYPioBcJ+7EnT8t8Xi4+WdA51UfMfqssiNJOl8FbP+q+t5HVk4X7l\nwZ8G5bwmJzcfI1dWjLBhn3VlhRikh7zFYTGzCagqVTQ3CNitx9tJIHkwFbcSWd7V\nuTOOTZg1sZXymJUS0sSo90FebMTouuUE+ZHKRjSUZG86AwshNeJIYz/nGsTgrpzK\n/Py2lssS2jugFMQetmLBlRkvbaFqIX5rBRyTBEhTOdfoAMC59bideNP7Ft+mJvFL\nud6wH+VHu770GYoWqnvCzxY0+gFEQJFAGZdT94bPgynS3SkxP7XXVFF5jxCdg8Os\n4Cq3E0ek5aELqJ9WAhZEEntqjYdOqgs4QfmpR+qlvdQ1XUeenfziUmr0a/PKITDl\nXWRT4oDAQAQMREUY3HljUEGQu6USwbIqOfEG9Rhg9AAuumOjhxXaUtLVoKm3uhJo\n+/HjGjcR5HKClNoWPtZHfAJFcBnxBwqlgxqaaOCGupq0gZdp8Eyzniup9sQOuOBs\nr4H5WIdO/+3kSzEWHP8qAFgdpQKKwuU3lfugUpcwIxWe9cYvJ3Tsajnm/CGFfa3Y\naWA1CVrXcxaW/5dN40E6\n=F10k\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"v