i.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/dorman/commits/d71f20d55d9226b16be65578355a0a2a3922e6bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:53:01Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:53:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: validate middleware configs and panic on unsafe zero values (#10)\n\nCSRFProtect now panics if Key is shorter than 32 bytes. RateLimit\npanics if Requests or Window is zero, including per-path rules.\nBruteForceProtect panics if MaxAttempts or Cooldown is zero.\n\nThese are programmer errors caught at init time, so panicking is\nappropriate (similar to regexp.MustCompile).\n\nCloses #3","tree":{"sha":"4daac935a069af879d2e031be63e39ee92a0a1ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/dorman/git/trees/4daac935a069af879d2e031be63e39ee92a0a1ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/dorman/git/commits/d71f20d55d9226b16be65578355a0a2a3922e6bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 4daac935a069af879d2e031be63e39ee92a0a1ed\nparent 94035db355be4dfb4409f37fc54092f4d1d3560c\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775573581 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775573581 -0500\n\nfix: validate middleware configs and panic on unsafe zero values (#10)\n\nCSRFProtect now panics if Key is shorter than 32 bytes. RateLimit\npanics if Requests or Window is zero, including per-path rules.\nBruteForceProtect panics if MaxAttempts or Cooldown is zero.\n\nThese are programmer errors caught at init time, so panicking is\nappropriate (similar to regexp.MustCompile).\n\nCloses #3","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1RpNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXXMQACbEtHSnLvMHCSOgVtey9i8L\nj9cxHtkYZATEqyHBks2vx6dgvpv7iU3oYj9xeuXIouRDzx6J1Qmrpri2QSrrgVqF\nPZfPndUdIVCaXTSqrWmL+RLGb2Jk+HnwxGhJ92HmyZ9fvVTVB27O+GHXAJ7jAiah\nwKM