,"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakemo136/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakemo136/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakemo136/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakemo136/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakemo136/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakemo136","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JakemoCode/frontend-orchestrator/commits/914a95aa07d6dd47b8407f5cdb2e1f7e96ff0ce2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T21:17:10Z","email":"jake136@yahoo.com","name":"Jake Mosher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T21:17:10Z","email":"jake136@yahoo.com","name":"Jake Mosher"},"message":"feat(protocols): bake review gate into build skills\n\nAdd a per-component / per-wave review gate to /build-component,\n/build-page, and /build-pipeline. Each gate invokes code-review\nand code-simplify after tests pass and loops until both return\nclean. Ship an opt-in PreToolUse hook that enforces the gate at\nthe harness level for teams that want hard enforcement.\n\nWhy: feature-complete tests alone don''t guarantee clean,\nconsistent, simplifiable code. Wiring review into the skill\ncycle means every plugin user gets it without having to\nremember.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f872c94d3a7b1756d97daf9461f511977b97eee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JakemoCode/frontend-orchestrator/git/trees/7f872c94d3a7b1756d97daf9461f511977b97eee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JakemoCode/frontend-orchestrator/git/commits/914a95aa07d6dd47b8407f5cdb2e1f7e96ff0ce2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42350975?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakemo136/e