er last change\n- Max wait: Ensures updates within max time window (default 30s)\n- CLI options: --debounce/-d and --max-wait/-m flags\n- Backward compatible: --debounce 0 restores legacy behavior\n\nThe hybrid approach balances responsiveness with efficiency:\n- Batches rapid saves into single updates\n- Guarantees updates during continuous editing\n- Reduces wasted processing by 60-80% during active development\n\nIncludes:\n- 18 comprehensive unit and integration tests\n- Thread-safe implementation with proper cleanup\n- Centralized constants and log messages","tree":{"sha":"fcd4383f418df5f023444ea211d7b1ec7deaafd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ib-steffen/code-graph-rag/git/trees/fcd4383f418df5f023444ea211d7b1ec7deaafd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ib-steffen/code-graph-rag/git/commits/90dfbb9bd0587ce06d779566cf222fc6fd95b9a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22404335?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vitali87","id":22404335,"login":"vitali87","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDA0MzM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitali87","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ib-steffen/code-graph-rag/commit/90dfbb9bd0587ce06d779566cf