om","name":"Senthil Kumar"},"message":"refactor: implement TaskScheduler one-time precise activation in FundConfigService\n\nReplace the every-minute @Scheduled cron on refreshActiveConfig() with a\nprecise one-time TaskScheduler task per future config, plus a daily midnight\n@Scheduled cron as a safety net.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f8c666ffd2b06d313576bf0244d90c400aae190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/git/trees/0f8c666ffd2b06d313576bf0244d90c400aae190"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/git/commits/f2a67d7dbd047bde86c0babe686c0bb021702bfe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129336956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/senthilknz","id":129336956,"login":"senthilknz","node_id":"U_kgDOB7WGfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commit/f2a67d7dbd047bde86c0babe686c0bb021702bfe","node_id":"C_kwDOR8Vm1NoAKGYyYTY3ZDdkYmQwNDdiZGU4NmMwYmFiZTY4NmMwYmIwMjE3MDJiZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commit/bdd8b9d026e527b7fce1f1c1a8e171921a9e78ff","sha":"bdd8b9d026e527b7fce1f1c1a8e171921a9e78ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commits/bdd8b9d026e527b7fce1f1c1a8e171921a9e78ff"}],"sha":"f2a67d7dbd047bde86c0babe686c0bb021702bfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commits/f2a67d7dbd047bde86c0babe686c0bb021702bfe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129336956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/senthilknz","id":129336956,"login":"senthilknz","node_id":"U_kgDOB7WGfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commits/bdd8b9d026e527b7fce1f1c1a8e171921a9e78ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T02:45:32Z","email":"senthilknz.anz@gmail.com","name":"Senthil Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T02:45:32Z","email":"senthilknz.anz@gmail.com","name":"Senthil Kumar"},"message":"refactor: replace every-minute cron with precise TaskScheduler + daily safety net\n\nActivation now fires exactly once per future config at its effectiveFrom\ninstant via TaskScheduler; a daily midnight @Scheduled cron acts as a\nsafety net for restarts and clock corrections. Zero unnecessary firings\nbetween quarterly updates.\n\n- FundConfigService: remove @Scheduled refreshActiveConfig(), add\n  scheduleNextActivation() (TaskScheduler one-time task) and\n  dailySafetyCheck() (midnight safety-net cron)\n- FundConfigServiceEdgeCaseTest: pass TaskScheduler mock as third\n  constructor arg to match updated @RequiredArgsConstructor signature\n- FundMetricsApiApplication: update @EnableScheduling Javadoc\n- README, component-diagram.puml, request-flow.puml,\n  quarterly-config-workflow.puml: reflect two-path scheduling design\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6baec2c3d545c1dcd4ecaaab382830576e7fff1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/git/trees/6baec2c3d545c1dcd4ecaaab382830576e7fff1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/git/commits/bdd8b9d026e527b7fce1f1c1a8e171921a9e78ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129336956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/senthilknz","id":129336956,"login":"senthilknz","node_id":"U_kgDOB7WGfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sen