ists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/senthilknz","id":129336956,"login":"senthilknz","node_id":"U_kgDOB7WGfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commits/5abcf626f4063e03221365bf53cef89d3101ec61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:37:20Z","email":"senthilknz.anz@gmail.com","name":"Senthil Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:37:20Z","email":"senthilknz.anz@gmail.com","name":"Senthil Kumar"},"message":"fix: use NZT (Pacific/Auckland) for fund config date resolution\n\nLocalDate.now() without a zone uses the JVM default (UTC on most servers),\nwhich returns the wrong date during the 12-13 hours each day when NZT is\nalready on the next calendar date. The @Scheduled cron also lacked a zone,\ncausing the midnight config-activation tick to fire at UTC midnight rather\nthan NZT midnight.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"018c8b993431639b0fd14888b3f524083d948706","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/git/trees/018c8b993431639b0fd14888b3f524083d948706"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/git/commits/5abcf626f4063e03221365bf53cef89d3101ec61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129336956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"ht