n":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commits/9eaf6d1ad0f2441ff88d10c891d43994b7f45c0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T18:31:28Z","email":"senthilknz.anz@gmail.com","name":"Senthil Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T18:31:28Z","email":"senthilknz.anz@gmail.com","name":"Senthil Kumar"},"message":"test: add full coverage for model, config, and service packages\n\nModel tests (pure unit, no Spring context):\n- FundTest, FundConfigTest: getters/setters, equals, hashCode, toString\n- FundFeeTest, RiskIndicatorTest, InvestmentTimeframeTest: same\n- MetricDescriptionTest: includes nullable optional fields (scale, periods)\n- FundChooserItemTest: builder + equals/hashCode/toString for all 4\n  nested display types (FeeDisplay, ReturnDisplay, TimeframeDisplay, RiskDisplay)\n  and the top-level item\n- FundChooserResponseTest: builder, equals, hashCode, toString\n\nConfig tests (@SpringBootTest + MockMvc):\n- OpenApiConfigTest: verifies title, version, description, contact, license\n- CorsConfigTest: preflight allowed/disallowed origins, GET/POST methods,\n  chooser endpoint, verifies disallowed origins get no CORS header\n\nService edge-case unit tests (mocked ResourcePatternResolver):\n- loadAllConfigs skips unparsable resources and loads valid ones\n- loadAllConfigs with empty resource list → empty history, null active\n- refreshActiveConfig with only future-dated configs → null active\n- resolveConfigForDate on exact effectiveFrom date → returns config\n- resolveConfigForDate one day before effectiveFrom → returns null\n\nTotal: 186 tests, 0 failures\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bf6dbec197c3464c85597eb36bd2405f3f2446a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/git/trees/7bf6dbec197c3464c85597eb36bd2405f3f2446a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/git/commits/9eaf6d1ad0f2441ff88d10c891d43994b7f45c0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129336956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/senthilknz","id":129336956,"login":"senthilknz","node_id":"U_kgDOB7WGfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senthilknz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commit/9eaf6d1ad0f2441ff88d10c891d43994b7f45c0b","node_id":"C_kwDOR8Vm1NoAKDllYWY2ZDFhZDBmMjQ0MWZmODhkMTBjODkxZDQzOTk0YjdmNDVjMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commit/bee83825cbe97c3f431c2247254a9d7e9ef146d3","sha":"bee83825cbe97c3f431c2247254a9d7e9ef146d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commits/bee83825cbe97c3f431c2247254a9d7e9ef146d3"}],"sha":"9eaf6d1ad0f2441ff88d10c891d43994b7f45c0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilknz/fund-metrics-api/commits/9eaf6d1ad0f2441ff88d10c891d43994b7f45c0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avata