 transfer data structure.\n- Removed status chip component from transfer list rendering.\n- Adjusted tests to validate new transfer summary display.\n\nfeat: implement account service for fetching account details\n\n- Created AccountService to handle API calls related to account information.\n- Added methods to find current account and retrieve account ID by user email.\n- Implemented tests for AccountService to ensure correct API interaction.\n\nfix: enhance error handling in user creation and login processes\n\n- Updated user creation and login pages to utilize new httpErrorMessage utility for better error messaging.\n- Ensured account information is updated upon user creation and login.\n\nrefactor: clean up unused DTOs and improve data handling\n\n- Removed obsolete FindManyDto and FindTransferDto interfaces.\n- Updated CreateTransferDto to reflect new property names.\n- Introduced PageDto for consistent pagination handling across services.\n\ntest: improve QR display component tests for better reliability\n\n- Modified QR display tests to use Promise.resolve for asynchronous operations.","tree":{"sha":"625443f0d7ccb9850fafbfe8b849851e8dff3859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Joaopdiasventura/Auronix-client/git/trees/625443f0d7ccb9850fafbfe8b849851e8dff3859"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Joaopdiasventura/Auronix-client/git/commits/e386268030fa392ab61257f1d98da44da123b260","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121265378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joaopdiasventura/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joaopdiasventura/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joaopdiasventura/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joaopdiasventura/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Joaopdiasventura","id":121265378,"login