0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T16:32:27Z","email":"zohar.babin@kaltura.com","name":"Zohar Babin"},"message":"feat(deploy): add agent fallback for scrapers that ignore content negotiation\n\nMost AI agent tools (MCP scrapers, Codex, Gemini CLI, Copilot) do not\nsend Accept: text/markdown — they get HTML and hallucinate from it.\n\nThree changes to fix discoverability without modifying the Worker:\n\n1. llms.txt now uses /raw/ URLs so any fetcher gets direct markdown links\n2. Every HTML page includes a hidden LLM directive with the raw URL,\n   the base API URL (api_v3), and a pointer to llms.txt\n3. Every HTML page includes <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/markdown\">\n   pointing to /raw/{filename}.md for programmatic discovery\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63f2cd0efacd1b409bd875c06c966a0a6afc177e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/trees/63f2cd0efacd1b409bd875c06c966a0a6afc177e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/commits/03caf50dfeda22f569ec9f87a59eac58e516cbe3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zoharbabin","id":150514,"login":"zoharbabin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDUxNA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/starred{