","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/commits/8d9204ccf7e873919157fb1b6a2658cd5c5279a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T04:04:39Z","email":"zohar.babin@kaltura.com","name":"Zohar Babin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T04:04:39Z","email":"zohar.babin@kaltura.com","name":"Zohar Babin"},"message":"fix(esearch): correct abstract orderBy, aggregation path, caption timestamps\n\nVerified 5 reported issues against the live API and fixed 3 guide bugs:\n- Use KalturaESearchEntryOrderByItem (concrete) not KalturaESearchOrderByItem (abstract)\n- Aggregation path is double-nested: searchParams[aggregations][aggregations][0]\n- Caption startsAt/endsAt are integers in milliseconds, not seconds\n\nAlso propagated the timestamp fix to the Captions & Transcripts guide\n(deep-linking section now divides by 1000 for player currentTime).\n\nAdded 7 new tests (25/25 passing), new Section 12 (Agent/LLM Integration).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c952e43700a7fa6addace7ffdd3b45eab9b03a6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/trees/c952e43700a7fa6addace7ffdd3b45eab9b03a6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/commits/8d9204ccf7e873919157fb1b6a2658cd5c5279a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zoharbabin","id":150514,"login":"zoharbabin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDUxNA==","organizations_url":"