ments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T05:24:07Z","email":"zohar.babin@kaltura.com","name":"Zohar Babin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T05:24:07Z","email":"zohar.babin@kaltura.com","name":"Zohar Babin"},"message":"feat: add CLAUDE.md, edit hook, and section indexes\n\nThree layers to mitigate agent context drift in long conversations:\n\n1. CLAUDE.md — loaded into every Claude Code session with\n   \"read before edit\" rule that survives context compaction\n2. .claude/settings.json — PreToolUse hook on Edit that injects\n   a reminder before every file edit\n3. Section index comments — HTML TOC in all 48 guides listing\n   section numbers/titles for quick structural awareness\n\nAlso: update Genie Widget guide with correct embed pattern\n(imperative loadRuntime + assignArea), full KS privilege set,\nand privacy context documentation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c218498e57c70d9e3c12cd89e83ef09108037e45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/trees/c218498e57c70d9e3c12cd89e83ef09108037e45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/commits/73f5dc8890c7810488c9f373fe5e50eec7f1e4c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zoharbabin","id":150514,"login":"zoharbabin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDUxNA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/received_events","repos_url":"h