ew tests\n(6→22) covering avatar templates, CRUD, audio preview, video generation, status\nlifecycle, error validation, and CDN/widget availability.\n\nKey additions:\n- Full server-side REST API documentation (15 endpoints)\n- Manual storyboard workflow with multi-source b-roll\n- Comparison table: manual vs AI composition vs hybrid approaches\n- Video status lifecycle diagram and field-level reference tables\n- 36 avatar templates, background types, scene/narration/broll objects\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42d57969bdbbe80a16f9e2fd389fe770bf8bd607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/trees/42d57969bdbbe80a16f9e2fd389fe770bf8bd607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/commits/d6c49f573c4041601fa66689f2b9b7d8766073d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zoharbabin","id":150514,"login":"zoharbabin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDUxNA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/commit/d6c49f