alysis from Kaltura API schema audit (142 services) and\nproduct research. Reorganized into 5 tiers by impact:\n\n- Tier 1 (Critical): Transcoding/Flavors, Clipping/Trimming, Thumbnails\n- Tier 2 (Next): Live Streaming, Playlists, Scheduling (existing)\n- Tier 3 (High): User Entry, Drop Folders, Interactive Video, DRM, Engagement\n- Tier 4: Extensions to existing guides (response profiles, groups, permissions, caption search, uiConf)\n- Tier 5: Specialized (content lifecycle, external media, audit trail, batch ops)\n\nAlso expanded API Landscape Reference to cover all discovered services.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d40f12f44667c725fd6164958572dc9b54f585a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/trees/d40f12f44667c725fd6164958572dc9b54f585a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaltura/kaltura-agents-api-guides/git/commits/f3b57de6b26d60e1753f6775fe37f946bf9d5d78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zoharbabin","id":150514,"login":"zoharbabin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDUxNA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharbabin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zoharba