me":"Pavan Kumar Bijjala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T03:17:31Z","email":"pbijjala@gmail.com","name":"Pavan Kumar Bijjala"},"message":"Add 05-data deep dive: MongoDB Atlas schema, indexes, vector search, init script\n\nschema-design.md:\n- 8 collections: agent_runs, approval_requests, audit_trail, sdlc_artifacts,\n  context_snapshots, vector_embeddings, langgraph_checkpoints, langgraph_writes\n- Full $jsonSchema per collection, index strategy, retention/TTL policy\n- Data flow diagram, Atlas M30 sizing, cross-references to Java domain classes\n  and Python SDLCState TypedDict\n\ninit-mongo.js (593 lines, fully idempotent mongosh script):\n- Creates all 8 collections with $jsonSchema validators (validationAction: warn)\n- 23 regular/unique indexes + 5 TTL indexes\n- Seed test documents (_testData: true) per collection with upsert\n- Summary table printed on completion\n\nvector-search-index.json:\n- Atlas vectorSearch index: embedding (1536-dim cosine) + filter fields\n  (productId, sourceType, stage)\n\nvector-search.md:\n- 4 use cases: context enrichment, Requirements/Architecture/Dev Crew queries\n- Index setup (Atlas CLI + UI), embedding generation (Java + Python)\n- 3 $vectorSearch aggregation patterns with PyMongo and MongoTemplate examples\n- ADR-004 context enrichment flow diagram\n- Cost/performance table (M30, embedding model options, numCandidates tuning)\n\nREADME: mark 05-data as Done, add ADR links, update rest-bridge entry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dabbe3629d714cc78d53861b9add4fb6ac84c266","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codepil/agentic-ai-platform/git/trees/dabbe3629d714cc78d53861b9add4fb6ac84c266"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codepil/agentic-ai-platform/git/commits/dcf7a6efe95a1b6905bdca211c105fd1b3cab67e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon