alausa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbijjalausa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbijjalausa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbijjalausa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbijjalausa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codepil/agentic-ai-platform/commits/93126a3306ed6edef26bcaae70b457b9225d182a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T02:45:05Z","email":"pbijjala@gmail.com","name":"Pavan Kumar Bijjala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T02:45:05Z","email":"pbijjala@gmail.com","name":"Pavan Kumar Bijjala"},"message":"Add ADR-002, ADR-003, ADR-004: agent orchestration, REST bridge, 3-tier architecture\n\nADR-002: Python + LangGraph + CrewAI for agent orchestration\n- LangGraph StateGraph for stateful SDLC with interrupt/resume at approval gates\n- CrewAI for multi-agent specialist crews per stage\n- MOCK_MODE for cost-free CI testing\n\nADR-003: FastAPI REST + SSE over gRPC for Java-Python bridge\n- HTTP/1.1 required for direct browser + Spring WebClient consumption\n- No proto files, no code generation, no gRPC-Web proxy\n- Per-run asyncio.Queue SSE pattern\n\nADR-004: 3-tier architecture with platform-core as context enrichment gateway\n- Proven enterprise pattern matching client''s existing Java stack\n- platform-core fetches Jira/SAP/Figma/GitHub context before calling agent-engine\n- Enterprise credentials stay in Java tier; agent-engine receives pre-enriched context\n- Progressive enhancement path: richer context per phase without changing agent code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12246aef31a0a19a546a7ae474e907ae8cfe9a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codepil/agentic-ai-platform/git/trees/12246aef31a0a19a546a7ae474e907ae8cfe9a8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codepil/agentic-ai-platform/git/commits/93126a33