ttps://api.github.com/repos/codepil/agentic-ai-platform/commits/dddc39c994df4312ed9dda849da5ea841fca47d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T00:48:53Z","email":"pbijjala@gmail.com","name":"Pavan Kumar Bijjala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T00:48:53Z","email":"pbijjala@gmail.com","name":"Pavan Kumar Bijjala"},"message":"Add Java platform-core: Spring Boot control plane + shared libs\n\n- platform-app: REST API (runs, approvals), WebSocket (STOMP/SockJS),\n  MongoDB (AgentRun, ApprovalRequest, AuditEvent), Okta JWT OAuth2\n- SecurityConfig: authorizeHttpRequests() scope rules (SCOPE_agents:run/read/approve)\n  with BearerTokenAuthenticationEntryPoint for 401/403 enforcement\n- AgentRunService: starts SDLC runs, calls agent-engine REST, subscribes SSE stream\n- ApprovalService: processes human approval gates, resumes LangGraph via agent-engine\n- AuditTrailService: async audit event persistence (@Async)\n- SlackNotificationService: Slack webhook alerts\n- AgentEventBroadcaster: STOMP WebSocket broadcast to ReactJS MFEs\n- lib-auth: OktaJwtValidator, PlatformSecurityContext, @RequiresScope annotation\n- lib-mongodb: BaseDocument with @CreatedDate/@LastModifiedDate, MongoConfig\n- lib-logging: MDC filter (runId/productId MDC injection), PlatformLogger\n- lib-sap: SapBapiClient (JCo/RFC), SapODataClient (S/4HANA REST APIs)\n- 18/18 tests passing under Java 25 / Spring Boot 3.4.4 / Mockito 5 (SubclassByteBuddyMockMaker)\n- 03-platform-core/project-structure.md: full documentation (control plane, coding\n  standards few-shot injection into Dev Crew, shared-lib usage guide)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f7352ffde3d6c1f473669d763b62a306c6fbc52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codepil/agentic-ai-platform/git/trees/0f7352ffde3d6c1f473669d763b62a306c6fbc52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codepil/agentic-ai-platform/git/commits/dddc39c994df4312ed9dda849da5ea841fca47d4","verification":{"pay