/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/commits/992ce9db1e101109d736aa20d981b0bba747dd6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T14:17:06Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"tiacquax-web"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T14:17:06Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"tiacquax-web"},"message":"fix: revisão completa enterprise ERP — dark theme, CRUD, Vercel deploy\n\n## Correções Críticas\n- vite.config.ts: .sandbox.novita.ai adicionado nos allowedHosts (erro de host bloqueado)\n- vite.config.ts: plugins Manus (jsx-loc, manus-runtime) carregados de forma async/opcional\n  — não quebram mais o build em produção quando ausentes\n- const.ts: getLoginUrl() retorna null quando VITE_OAUTH_PORTAL_URL não está definido\n  — corrige crash ''Invalid URL: undefined/app-auth'' no carregamento\n- useAuth.ts: getLoginUrl() chamado de forma lazy dentro do hook\n- DashboardLayout.tsx: tratamento de loginUrl null, sem redirect para undefined\n- main.tsx: redirectToLoginIfUnauthorized guarda contra loginUrl null\n- vercel.json (raiz do repo): aponta build para sistema-gestao/ corrigindo\n  o erro ''npm run build exited with code 1'' no Vercel\n\n## Novos Modais CRUD\n- ContasPagarPro: Nova Conta, Marcar como Pago, highlight vencidas, dropdown ações\n- ContasReceberPro: Nova Conta a Receber, Marcar como Recebido, highlight atrasadas\n- CRMPro: Novo Lead completo, dropdown Kanban por card\n\n## Design Dark Theme (317 ocorrências corrigidas)\n- 13 páginas Pro: cores light → variáveis CSS dark-theme\n- NotFound: redesenhado enterprise dark\n- Botões padronizados: bg-primary/bg-destructive\n\n## Backend APIs\n- financial.summary, summaryPayable, summaryReceivable com campos overdue/thisWeek\n- crm.stats, projects.stats\n- vercel.json sistema-gestao: rewrites SPA\n\n## Dashboard, Configurações, Sidebar\n- Saudação dinâmica, tabs com dados reais, pipeline de vendas\n- Página Configurações completa (Perfil, Empresa, Notificações, Segurança)\n- Grupo ''Sistema'' na sidebar, dropdown usuário com links","tree":{"sha":"afedd24318d601931274b9237b7a0b0c5f9d99e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/git/trees/afedd24318d601931274b9237b7a0b0c5f9d99e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/git/commits/992ce9db1e101109d736aa20d981b0bba747dd6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/commit/992ce9db1e101109d736aa20d981b0bba747dd6f","node_id":"C_kwDOR8jiNNoAKDk5MmNlOWRiMWUxMDExMDlkNzM2YWEyMGQ