.com/users/tiacquax-web/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiacquax-web/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiacquax-web","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/commits/0c11f3e28688016e7cceb251fa8ddc4f6755ead3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T12:44:24Z","email":"tiacquax-web@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tiacquax-web"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T12:44:24Z","email":"tiacquax-web@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tiacquax-web"},"message":"fix: comprehensive dark-theme & functionality overhaul for enterprise ERP\n\n## Login & Authentication\n- Redesigned login screen with enterprise branding, loading state, feature strip\n- Fixed: no more blank/broken screen when not authenticated\n\n## Design System (index.css)\n- Complete dark theme refresh with proper oklch color tokens\n- Added badge-* utility classes (badge-success, badge-warning, etc.)\n- Added erp-page and stat-card helper classes\n\n## DashboardLayout\n- Added ''Sistema'' menu group with Configurações + Administração items\n- Fixed user dropdown: now includes both Configurações and Administração links\n- Improved sidebar active state styling\n\n## DashboardProfissional (Dashboard)\n- Fixed hardcoded ''Giulia'' → now uses dynamic user.name from auth\n- Added dynamic greeting (Bom dia/tarde/noite)\n- Filled all 4 tabs: Visão Geral, Financeiro, Vendas/CRM, Operacional\n- Fixed all light-color classes for dark theme compatibility\n- Added pipeline chart in Vendas tab with progress bars\n- Added proper quick access links in each tab\n\n## All Pro Pages (13 pages fixed)\n- Replaced all hardcoded light Tailwind colors:\n  bg-gray-* → bg-card/bg-muted/bg-accent\n  text-gray-* → text-foreground/text-muted-foreground\n  bg-*-50/100 → bg-*-500/10 (dark-compatible alphas)\n  text-*-800 → text-*-400 (lighter for dark backgrounds)\n  badge classes → dark alpha variants\n- Fixed hardcoded gradient backgrounds → bg-background\n\n## New Page: Configurações (/configuracoes)\n- 4 tabs: Perfil, Empresa, Notificações, Segurança\n- User avatar with initials, editable profile fields\n- Notification preferences panel\n- Active session management\n- Password change form\n\n## Backend API Fixes\n- financial.summary: new combined endpoint for dashboard KPIs\n- financial.summaryPayable: added total, overdue, thisWeek, paidThisMonth fields\n- financial.summaryReceivable: added total, overdue, thisWeek, receivedThisMonth fields\n- crm.stats: new endpoint (totalLeads, activeLeads, closedWon, closedLost)\n- projects.stats: new endpoint (total, inProgress, completed, planned, paused)\n\n## Dependencies\n- Installed: @trpc/server, next-themes, tw-animate-css, @builder.io/vite-plugin-jsx-loc, vite-plugin-manus-runtime\n- Fixed: index.html analytics placeholders no longer cause 403 errors","tree":{"sha":"d71027354d720bbf3e5360f7ea2aa1453ad55a0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/git/trees/d71027354d720bbf3e5360f7ea2aa1453ad55a0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/git/commits/0c11f3e28688016e7cceb251fa8ddc4f6755ead3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265306675?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiacquax-web/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiacquax-web/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiacquax-web/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiacquax-web/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tiacquax-web","id":265306675,"login":"tiacquax-web","node_id":"U_kgDOD9BCMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiacquax-web/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiacquax-web/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.