ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruivagiulia-art","id":265843522,"login":"ruivagiulia-art","node_id":"U_kgDOD9hzQg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/commits/74df3e984b32ae7576cade12956bd59d130f7701/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T16:39:52Z","email":"ruivagiulia@gmail.com","name":"Giulia Marques"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T16:40:05Z","email":"ruivagiulia@gmail.com","name":"Giulia Marques"},"message":"feat: adicionar 11 páginas profissionais ao ERP\n\nCriadas páginas modernas e profissionais para completar o sistema:\n\n## Páginas Financeiras\n- ContasReceberPro: tema verde, gestão de receitas com filtros e tabs\n- CentroCustoPro: tema roxo, organização por tipos (obra, serviço, admin)\n\n## CRM e Vendas\n- CRMPro: funil kanban completo com 6 estágios, drag-and-drop visual\n\n## Gestão de Projetos\n- ProjetosPro: grid de projetos com status, prioridades e orçamentos\n\n## Clientes\n- ClientesPro: CRUD completo, filtros PF/PJ, importação CSV\n\n## Compras\n- OrdensCompraPro: gestão de pedidos com workflow de aprovação\n\n## Comunicação\n- ChatPro: estilo Slack, conversas em tempo real\n- AgendaPro: calendário visual com eventos e compromissos\n\n## Documentos e BI\n- DocumentosPro: estilo Google Drive, categorias e upload\n- RelatoriosPro: dashboard BI com 4 tabs de análise\n\n## Administração\n- AdminPro: painel admin com logs, sistema e performance\n\n## Infraestrutura\n- Criado router admin para logs e estatísticas\n- Atualizadas todas as rotas no App.tsx\n- Mantidas versões antigas para compatibilidade\n\nTodas as páginas seguem os padrões:\n✅ Animações Framer Motion\n✅ Loading states e skeletons\n✅ Empty states amigáveis\n✅ Cards de métricas\n✅ Busca e filtros avançados\n✅ Status badges coloridos\n✅ Responsividade completa\n✅ Hover effects e transições\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9feba0c8e171f41d04286c7baf5b916b309fdcfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/git/trees/9feba0c8e171f41d04286c7baf5b916b309fdcfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/git/commits/74df3e984b32ae7576cade12956bd59d130f7701","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265843522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruivagiulia-art","id":265843522,"login":"ruivagiulia-art","node_id":"U_kgDOD9hzQg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruivagiulia-art","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tiacquax-web/GrupoGab/commit/74df3e984b32ae7576cade