ommand output display\n- Local mode: \"Configure Gateway\" button now opens the control panel\n  instead of showing \"requires gateway\" error\n- i18n keys added for all 10 locales","tree":{"sha":"19e18f88df5b16c8bb100ecacfd85ab385470b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khamis1992/mission-control/git/trees/19e18f88df5b16c8bb100ecacfd85ab385470b67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khamis1992/mission-control/git/commits/712805831d3e4ed4b0634770121b92c447d79659","verification":{"payload":"tree 19e18f88df5b16c8bb100ecacfd85ab385470b67\nparent a0a4d60451d42df5460c9cb4b031f91b5d9cab4e\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1775283251 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775283251 +0700\n\nfeat: gateway control panel — start, stop, restart, diagnose (#552)\n\nAdd a gateway management panel accessible from the local mode banner''s\n\"Configure Gateway\" button. Works in local mode (was previously blocked\nwith \"requires gateway\" message).\n\n- New POST /api/gateways/control endpoint for gateway lifecycle actions\n- Supports both Hermes (hermes gateway start/stop/restart, hermes doctor)\n  and OpenClaw (openclaw gateway start/stop/restart, openclaw doctor)\n- Gateway status detection: Hermes via PID file, OpenClaw via health probe\n- GatewayControlPanel: shows installed gateways with status, controls,\n  and command output display\n- Local mode: \"Configure Gateway\" button now opens the control panel\n  instead of showing \"requires gateway\" error\n- i18n keys added for all 10 locales","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp0KwzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3RoQAB7Si98H/+YW1+2ZVAnj6cSA\nuA3eMCdapN8bYmqpfzHTNiM2prjPEMvqEmEQyCLtx2syIFhaLK9ZhNHDUIhCt4p/\nv9Maoruu+nQOYVoIA1rnQCq5pMe9NkPatpYU/hRq5IXQOUz7EOr0wfXuGwti0d1B\nus+LtXG7Lcz9K/ZVuM/prxGiG4EhunU4JqXDUawHbSYu+SqzxSD7pTvbUeIgRlML\ntRMsV7sbE7dyIn7cy4AKKT1UbE1ZYD31nYPcovdNbnAb1E7iKZD9iitHJluuskEG\njOw8sfqEl7fQt9LFo5L4mCL2OFGYqUGiZvhU0osto6XOnwA0/F1CpGOKugqyK9yY\n1do