:"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T16:45:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(status): use Ollama HTTP API for local model discovery (#534)","tree":{"sha":"e409c5fa94a5f3a77b223928ed6a176c034cb7f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khamis1992/mission-control/git/trees/e409c5fa94a5f3a77b223928ed6a176c034cb7f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khamis1992/mission-control/git/commits/3e8617d712fb417643f74cc060728e96388ed8f9","verification":{"payload":"tree e409c5fa94a5f3a77b223928ed6a176c034cb7f3\nparent 1362be19a7b92d727f49edde895f7048d652edad\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774975516 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774975516 +0700\n\nfix(status): use Ollama HTTP API for local model discovery (#534)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpy/ocCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAl2cQAI95xPF/JPFK2iyg0jkpfoPS\n+xuGeePifkyTBnMbh4kQ3+cujNKUUNHf98Rg4/zWwuHe7cwAjPAB9fcWRQFn7EES\nVg6GWou3uyTgJ3o38AUkRKc+M3/Z1jEG/GWP8C+jDklssZcFvUeg2sHJ00O2V5yj\nmMhTikoHF1WuLN1aDeFp9g9ip0tcF42DZUx9PMkS1BaeHU/nSj4AP76x1ud2LmVG\nYeelM/vK59Ud6553zLqZQCvA4YdI5ZjlhjSNujDBDzTfH64luxxN1dSHT+gZ11So\nUfp01gAVKPsf1YYIO5zqsBFUfWLeomQ8fzNIL4X9T1SEHkILQpTUm6ZkkLWxPqoB\nziRx+K6Gv84o2YOg3gpNPaSWz0H9aiO7RdVTENEExpa+83dfbwJExYJBCQ3AnDcR\nhvwRCZAS1f3TPSvo3gP2j1SYbYBQdOEU21B9Uhf7KY+vMG+Gbbm3tlMu+WdAih76\nhWQKW0l1rlvBy+/JH5OaI61Pwq0htl9Z/iH1KV7/SdIkuJvq9Gqn+FN+MjjqbsaX\n8dsg6IGd3kU/6Yb8hsJXeXdOWjjbklvh2fFX3aYDJ+HGlLfW03ZvJYMJ8OCURQuk\nS2/TceKEZuVnJLU37JtNrDtc6t/aLVRksnOaYOqcJ27WTgFsGNVtGsO273EL3Tbq\nMP1UHr9ePI5rf7N6Rn7q\n=fe3g\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-08T03:58:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}