hooks `MarkdownRenderer` into the comment render function,\nconsistent with how task descriptions are already rendered elsewhere in\nthe same component.\n\nNo new dependencies introduced.","tree":{"sha":"2aeb0c6c1856a52015d174db19ab64c8d68f0d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khamis1992/mission-control/git/trees/2aeb0c6c1856a52015d174db19ab64c8d68f0d26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khamis1992/mission-control/git/commits/4ef91d44ad975e0ba2eded08c39432cb43e21609","verification":{"payload":"tree 2aeb0c6c1856a52015d174db19ab64c8d68f0d26\nparent 5604758a6577a148e145014b2ad95405b2036f77\nauthor Shipu Ahamed <shipuahamed01@gmail.com> 1774515199 +0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774515199 +0700\n\nfix: render markdown in task comments (#506)\n\nTask comments were rendered as plain text with `whitespace-pre-wrap`\ndespite `MarkdownRenderer` already being imported in the file and used\nfor task descriptions and other sections.\n\nAgent resolutions often contain markdown tables, code blocks, headers,\nand bullet lists. Without markdown rendering, these appeared as raw\nsymbols and were hard to read.\n\nThis change hooks `MarkdownRenderer` into the comment render function,\nconsistent with how task descriptions are already rendered elsewhere in\nthe same component.\n\nNo new dependencies introduced.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpxPP/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6P0QAFKfqMgE4gzC1iLFInYNxNhw\n7ofxg6nJs3Be4nc9JjhgPCf6tTxz7PoofVKHdsWu/BMyq2DNym4loKP8HERH+d5I\nqNMY7Ef1zSjEqCn6+XzjKHpp/Uuh9PwWHL1X2axqYTAcRwlnEV6a1J0Ts39xsvDQ\n+x93WfG4IuIiloQ4SUSImtuTreBsOmVCapmmGRxJKGYNIVEJRaFLsw9T9frdtQ/6\nj+yO8jG2gqSWhZbIhEHyRLS7n1D88GSL3KwmKQVS1qHeA9pOECHfQK82ivpZryqB\nb20sntoWE7Gcsy66kB8bmVgiuGQUkcgjASu3yrvXpg0Rnzwvzg+d7wRmPfWSJ/y4\ndSr71q/D+rJiVtbz8BnrYqDxVMH3jDIiLq8pFZ3Yzd9MzStyVjMDdc3c+pKhm9b3\nKym6u+xsaqbTpkfYPWfvhslWbSgkibuA5sp1TBCKwBElDbeVX2sxUcK+PdPGefG8\nMtPVbAryEM+QcDQdhi/XOp/DQlg29oltNaITdq0U1lwUu42oT9aUE1I7huzZiKjD\n0YEm3/rL