s attribution, tasks broadcast,\n  sessions transcript, tokens agent-costs/task-costs/trends/export/rotate,\n  status health/overview/dashboard/gateway/models/capabilities,\n  export audit/tasks/activities/pipelines\n- Add proper SSE streaming for events watch (NDJSON in --json mode,\n  human-readable otherwise, graceful Ctrl+C shutdown)\n- Add optional() helper for flags with defaults\n- Update docs/cli-agent-control.md with full v2 command reference","tree":{"sha":"fac086491e3b02941f42f9ca8891eb3a4630632f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khamis1992/mission-control/git/trees/fac086491e3b02941f42f9ca8891eb3a4630632f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khamis1992/mission-control/git/commits/f2747b53300777805d31e064a3a423c630fed73b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khamis1992/mission-control/commit/f2747b53300777805d31e064a3a423c630fed73b","node_id":"C_kwDOR8sI2toAKGYyNzQ3YjUzMzAwNzc3ODA1ZDMxZTA2NGEzYTQyM2M2MzBmZWQ3M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khamis1992/mi