e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/8dcc21cdce0538d8b7eabf929aa61ca9c63cb4b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T01:00:03Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T01:00:03Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"message":"feat: earnings score history — clickable row expansion with sparkline + quarter table\n\nTask: Make the earnings score history visible (track scores across multiple quarters)\n\nBackend changes:\n- Added `get_history_for_symbol(symbol)` to earnings_scanner_service.py: queries\n  all `earnings_alerts` rows for a symbol ordered period_end ASC (oldest → newest)\n- Added `GET /api/earnings-scanner/history/{symbol}` route in earnings_scanner.py:\n  auth-gated, returns { symbol, history: [...], count } — no new DB schema needed\n  since earnings_alerts already stores one row per (symbol, period_end, basis)\n\nFrontend changes (EarningsRadar.tsx):\n- Added expand/collapse toggle chevron column to the main table (9 cols total)\n- Clicking any company row toggles an inline HistoryPanel below it\n- HistoryPanel fetches from the new history endpoint (TanStack Query, 5-min stale)\n- HistoryPanel renders:\n  • An SVG sparkline (ScoreSparkline component) — oldest → newest with a dashed\n    alert-threshold line at score=6, coloured dots (emerald/amber/grey by tier)\n  • A compact sub-table showing up to 6 quarters newest-first with columns:\n    Quarter | Basis | Score (with ↑/↓/— trend icon vs prior quarter) | Rev YoY | PAT YoY | OPM\n- Only one row expands at a time; clicking the same row collapses it\n- ChartButton click propagation stopped so it doesn''t toggle the expand state\n- Used React.Fragment with key= (not <>) to allow keyed fragment pairs in tbody\n- info tooltip text updated to mention click-to-expand history\n\nNo deviations from the task spec. All pre-existing TypeScript errors are in\nunrelated files (sidebar.tsx, Dashboard.tsx, NewsFeed.tsx) — not introduced here.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 2043d6b7-94bd-40fb-959b-5da1a9b05867","tree":{"sha":"ad8ec190f704d1a847ff50e0022f94b0950e80d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/trees/ad8ec190f704d1a847ff50e0022f94b0950e80d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/commits/8dcc21cdce0538d8b7eabf929aa61ca9c63cb4b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274369934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap","id":274369934,"login":"n4nirmalyapratap","node_id":"U_kgDOEFqNjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/8dcc21cdce0538d8b7eabf929aa61ca9c63cb4b8","node_id":"C_kwDOR8tvD9oAKDhkY2MyMWNkY2UwNTM4ZDhiN2VhYmY5MjlhYTYxY2E5YzYzY2I0Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/280b01e3ab579a67fba1e939ad906336bd9069a8","sha":"280b01e3ab579a67fba1e939ad906336bd9069a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/280b01e3ab579a67fba1e939ad906336bd9069a8"}],"sha":"8dcc21cdce0538d8b7eabf929aa61ca9c63cb4b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/8dcc21cdce0538d8b7eabf929aa61ca9c63cb4b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274369934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap","id":274369934,"login":"n4nirmalyapratap","node_id":"U_kgDOEFqNjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/280b01e3ab579a67fba1e939ad906336bd9069a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:17:02Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:17:02Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"message":"feat: Real-Time Earnings Scanner — final (Task #7, all review cycles resolved)\n\nAll code-review rejections addressed across 4 review cycles:\n\n## Backend — earnings_scanner_service.py\n- Scheduler: 3-min interval + Mon–Fri 09:00–17:30 IST market-hours gate\n- Feeds: NSE primary (`svc.nse.fetch_nse`) + BSE secondary (2 pages), merged/deduped\n- Symbol resolution: BSE numeric SCRIP_CD → NSE symbol via stocks table\n- YoY baseline: `_find_yoy_quarter()` matches by date (q0_date − 365d ±45d), not by index\n- `_quarters_for_symbol()` returns `list[tuple[date, dict]]`; `_score_filing()` unpacks tuples\n- Force-refresh: `get_financial_results(..., force=True, quarters=6)` for every filer\n- Canonical symbol: `canonical_symbol()` applied before ALL DB reads/writes/alerts\n- Telegram: absolute ₹Cr for Revenue+PAT, OPM \"↑ BEAT\"/\"↓ MISS\", exceptional items line\n\n## Backend — auth_store.py\n- Safe migration: DO block drops old table if `basis` column missing\n- New PK `(symbol, period_end, basis)`, new columns: `basis`, `score_breakdown`,\n  `key_metrics`, `alerted`, `created_at_ms`\n\n## Backend — earnings_scanner.py\n- `/alerts`: real offset pagination, returns `total`/`hasMore`, exposes `basis`/`scoreBreakdown`/`keyMetrics`\n- `/scan`: admin-only, accepts optional `chatId`\n- `/stats`: summary counts\n\n## Frontend — EarningsRadar.tsx\n- `refetchInterval: 2 * 60_000`\n- \"Scan Now\" mutation: admin-gated, includes `Content-Type: application/json` header\n- Pagination (Prev/Next + total), score badge+bar, per-metric breakdown, alert status\n\n## Frontend — InsightsLayout.tsx\n- Tab order: Company Filings → Earnings Radar → MF Holdings → … → Corp. Events\n  (immediately after Company Filings, as specified)","tree":{"sha":"ea470c1760c6ffd7957d7d036f3841a377af72ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/trees/ea470c1760c6ffd7957d7d036f3841a377af72ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/commits/280b01e3ab579a67fba1e939ad906336bd9069a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274369934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap","id":274369934,"login":"n4nirmalyapratap","node_id":"U_kgDOEFqNjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/280b01e3ab579a67fba1e939ad906336bd9069a8","node_id":"C_kwDOR8tvD9oAKDI4MGIwMWUzYWI1NzlhNjdmYmExZTkzOWFkOTA2MzM2YmQ5MDY5YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/022565d3dde224a2d424fd4d9b90f7eeb4939b8d","sha":"022565d3dde224a2d424fd4d9b90f7eeb4939b8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/022565d3dde224a2d424fd4d9b90f7eeb4939b8d"}],"sha":"280b01e3ab579a67fba1e939ad906336bd9069a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/280b01e3ab579a67fba1e939ad906336bd9069a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274369934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap","id":274369934,"login":"n4nirmalyapratap","node_id":"U_kgDOEFqNjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/022565d3dde224a2d424fd4d9b90f7eeb4939b8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:12:55Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:12:55Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"message":"feat: Real-Time Earnings Scanner — v3 (Task #7, all code-review fixes)\n\n## Summary of all fixes applied across 3 review cycles\n\n### Backend — earnings_scanner_service.py\n\n**Scheduler**\n- Poll interval: 3 min (`_POLL_INTERVAL_S = 3 * 60`)\n- Market-hours gate: `_is_market_hours()` — Mon–Fri 09:00–17:30 IST only\n\n**Feeds**\n- NSE primary: `_fetch_nse_recent_results()` via `svc.nse.fetch_nse()`\n- BSE secondary: `_fetch_bse_recent_results()` (2 pages, \"Result\" category)\n- `_resolve_bse_symbol()` maps BSE numeric SCRIP_CD → NSE symbol via stocks table\n- `_collect_filers()` merges both feeds, deduplicates by NSE symbol (NSE-first)\n\n**YoY baseline fix (critical)**\n- `_quarters_for_symbol()` now returns `list[tuple[date, dict]]` (period_end + line_items)\n- Added `_find_yoy_quarter()`: finds the quarter whose period_end is closest to\n  q0_date − 365 days within ±45 days — correct same-quarter-last-year matching\n- `_score_filing()` unpacks `(date, dict)` tuples; uses date-based YoY, index-based QoQ\n- Gracefully handles missing YoY base (scores QoQ-only criteria when no year-ago data)\n\n**Force-refresh for fresh filings**\n- `scan_recent_results()` calls `get_financial_results(..., force=True, quarters=6)`\n  so filings posted within the last 24 h cache window are always picked up immediately\n\n**Telegram format**\n- Revenue and PAT show absolute ₹Cr + YoY % + per-criterion [pts/2] tag\n- OPM line shows direction as \"↑ BEAT\" / \"↓ MISS\" vs prior year\n- Exceptional items: ✅ / ⚠️ beat/miss line + finance cost % change\n\n### Backend — auth_store.py\n- Safe migration: DO block drops old `earnings_alerts` table if `basis` column absent\n- New PK: `(symbol, period_end, basis)`; new columns: `basis`, `score_breakdown`,\n  `key_metrics`, `alerted`, `created_at_ms`\n\n### Backend — earnings_scanner.py routes\n- `GET /alerts`: offset pagination, returns `total`, `hasMore`, exposes `basis`/`scoreBreakdown`/`keyMetrics`\n- `POST /scan`: admin-only, accepts optional `chatId`, 120 s timeout\n- `GET /stats`: unchanged\n\n### Frontend — EarningsRadar.tsx\n- `refetchInterval: 2 * 60_000` (auto-refresh while tab is open)\n- \"Scan Now\" button: admin-gated via `user?.isAdmin`, calls `POST /api/earnings-scanner/scan`\n- Pagination: Prev/Next with offset + total count\n- Score badge + bar, Revenue/PAT YoY, QoQ, OPM+quality checks, Telegram alert status\n\n### Frontend — InsightsLayout.tsx\n- Tab placed directly before Corp. Events\n  Order: Company Filings → Earnings Radar → Corp. Events","tree":{"sha":"0980c673863f5ed14967859c62a6eee83d798cdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/trees/0980c673863f5ed14967859c62a6eee83d798cdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/commits/022565d3dde224a2d424fd4d9b90f7eeb4939b8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274369934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap","id":274369934,"login":"n4nirmalyapratap","node_id":"U_kgDOEFqNjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/022565d3dde224a2d424fd4d9b90f7eeb4939b8d","node_id":"C_kwDOR8tvD9oAKDAyMjU2NWQzZGRlMjI0YTJkNDI0ZmQ0ZDliOTBmN2VlYjQ5MzliOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/e8565ad3558165df3bf0b72e4db88790f21d3aa4","sha":"e8565ad3558165df3bf0b72e4db88790f21d3aa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/e8565ad3558165df3bf0b72e4db88790f21d3aa4"}],"sha":"022565d3dde224a2d424fd4d9b90f7eeb4939b8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/022565d3dde224a2d424fd4d9b90f7eeb4939b8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274369934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap","id":274369934,"login":"n4nirmalyapratap","node_id":"U_kgDOEFqNjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/e8565ad3558165df3bf0b72e4db88790f21d3aa4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:07:31Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T16:07:31Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"message":"feat: Real-Time Earnings Scanner — v2 (Task #7, all code-review fixes applied)\n\n## Critical fixes from first code review\n\n### Scheduler\n- Interval: 3 min (`_POLL_INTERVAL_S = 3 * 60`), was 30 min\n- Market-hours gate: `_is_market_hours()` — Mon–Fri 09:00–17:30 IST, skips weekends\n\n### Feeds\n- Added `_fetch_nse_recent_results()` — polls NSE `/api/corporate-announcements`\n  via the existing `svc.nse.fetch_nse()` infrastructure; gives clean NSE symbols\n- `_fetch_bse_recent_results()` kept as BSE secondary feed (2 pages, \"Result\" category)\n- `_resolve_bse_symbol()` maps BSE numeric SCRIP_CD → NSE symbol via `stocks` table\n- `_collect_filers()` merges both feeds, deduplicates by NSE symbol (NSE-first)\n\n### DB schema (auth_store.py)\n- Safe migration: DO block drops old `earnings_alerts` table if `basis` column absent\n- New PK: `(symbol, period_end, basis)`\n- New columns: `basis`, `score_breakdown`, `key_metrics`, `alerted`, `created_at_ms`\n- Old column names (`detail_json`, `telegram_sent`) replaced\n\n### API (earnings_scanner.py)\n- `GET /alerts`: real pagination with `offset`, returns `total`, `hasMore`, `offset`\n- Exposes `basis`, `scoreBreakdown`, `keyMetrics` per row\n- `POST /scan`: admin-only, body may include `chatId` override\n- `GET /stats`: unchanged\n\n### Frontend (EarningsRadar.tsx)\n- `refetchInterval: 2 * 60_000` — auto-refreshes while tab is open\n- \"Scan Now\" button: admin-gated via `user?.isAdmin === true` from `useCustomAuth`\n  calls `POST /api/earnings-scanner/scan` via `useMutation`\n- Pagination: Prev/Next buttons with offset, total count display\n- Columns: symbol, quarter/basis, score badge + bar, Revenue/PAT YoY, QoQ,\n  OPM & quality checks, Telegram alert status, scanned-at time\n- `keyMetrics` and `scoreBreakdown` rendered per row\n\n### Tab placement (InsightsLayout.tsx)\n- Moved from before MF Holdings → directly before Corp. Events\n  Order: …Company Filings → Earnings Radar → Corp. Events…\n\n### Telegram format\n- Per-criterion point breakdown with pts annotations\n- OPM direction arrow, finance cost % change shown","tree":{"sha":"c9302c4a968898a080d925dec642aa725ae894ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/trees/c9302c4a968898a080d925dec642aa725ae894ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/commits/e8565ad3558165df3bf0b72e4db88790f21d3aa4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274369934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap","id":274369934,"login":"n4nirmalyapratap","node_id":"U_kgDOEFqNjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/e8565ad3558165df3bf0b72e4db88790f21d3aa4","node_id":"C_kwDOR8tvD9oAKGU4NTY1YWQzNTU4MTY1ZGYzYmYwYjcyZTRkYjg4NzkwZjIxZDNhYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/1590db63525d24b1ab9b3a0c7a4ebee02cf93baa","sha":"1590db63525d24b1ab9b3a0c7a4ebee02cf93baa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/1590db63525d24b1ab9b3a0c7a4ebee02cf93baa"}],"sha":"e8565ad3558165df3bf0b72e4db88790f21d3aa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/e8565ad3558165df3bf0b72e4db88790f21d3aa4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274369934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap","id":274369934,"login":"n4nirmalyapratap","node_id":"U_kgDOEFqNjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/1590db63525d24b1ab9b3a0c7a4ebee02cf93baa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:57:51Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:57:51Z","email":"n4nirmalyapratap@gmail.com","name":"n4nirmalyapratap"},"message":"feat: Real-Time Earnings Scanner (Task #7 — Earnings Radar)\n\n## What was built\n\n### Backend\n- **`app/services/earnings_scanner_service.py`** — Core scanning service:\n  - Polls BSE corporate API filtered for \"Result\" category announcements\n  - For each filer, triggers XBRL data refresh via `financial_results_service`\n  - Scores each filing on 10-point algorithm:\n    • Revenue YoY >15%=2pts / 5–15%=1pt\n    • PAT YoY >20%=2pts / 10–20%=1pt\n    • QoQ: both Revenue AND PAT up = 2pts\n    • OPM expansion YoY = 2pts\n    • No negative exceptional + finance costs YoY down = 2pts\n  - Sends Telegram alert (score ≥ 6) with deduplication per symbol+quarter\n  - Background scheduler loop every 30 minutes\n  - `get_alerts()` public read function\n\n- **`app/routes/earnings_scanner.py`** — Three API routes:\n  - `GET /api/earnings-scanner/alerts` (auth required, paginable)\n  - `GET /api/earnings-scanner/stats` (auth required, summary counts)\n  - `POST /api/earnings-scanner/scan` (admin-only, triggers on-demand scan)\n\n- **`app/lib/auth_store.py`** — Added `earnings_alerts` PG table to\n  `ensure_primary_schema()` with `(symbol, period_end)` composite PK,\n  `detail_json JSONB`, `telegram_sent`, and score index.\n\n- **`main.py`** — Imported router, added `_earnings_scanner_loop()` scheduler\n  function, registered task in lifespan, added router to app.\n\n### Frontend\n- **`src/pages/insights/tabs/EarningsRadar.tsx`** — Full tab UI:\n  - Score tier filter pills (All / High ≥6 / Medium 4–5 / Low <4)\n  - Compact symbol search\n  - Stats pills (high/medium/total)\n  - Table with score badge + score bar, per-metric % changes, quality checks\n  - Telegram alert status badge (Sent / Pending)\n  - Scoring methodology legend at bottom\n\n- **`src/pages/insights/InsightsLayout.tsx`** — Added \"earnings-radar\" tab\n  with Zap icon (yellow) positioned after Company Filings.","tree":{"sha":"ef33a5de0470b0af82983bbe4938bda8a60a14cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/trees/ef33a5de0470b0af82983bbe4938bda8a60a14cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/git/commits/1590db63525d24b1ab9b3a0c7a4ebee02cf93baa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274369934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap","id":274369934,"login":"n4nirmalyapratap","node_id":"U_kgDOEFqNjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/n4nirmalyapratap","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/1590db63525d24b1ab9b3a0c7a4ebee02cf93baa","node_id":"C_kwDOR8tvD9oAKDE1OTBkYjYzNTI1ZDI0YjFhYjliM2EwYzdhNGViZWUwMmNmOTNiYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commit/95077b773bd80978fcdaf47acf34708703a4e82b","sha":"95077b773bd80978fcdaf47acf34708703a4e82b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/95077b773bd80978fcdaf47acf34708703a4e82b"}],"sha":"1590db63525d24b1ab9b3a0c7a4ebee02cf93baa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits/1590db63525d24b1ab9b3a0c7a4ebee02cf93baa"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/n4nirmalyapratap/indian-stock-market-analyzer/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=e09c8cfb2559654b7b94606040819983c1720cd5&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A25%3A07.550Z"}');
