8e7ad37eaa62f92371db1","node_id":"C_kwDOR829YtoAKDJjOWRlNDk0ZDQ4Nzc2MjY2MmY4ZTdhZDM3ZWFhNjJmOTIzNzFkYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/67c6c4695759ae69647d892c7b268a8969334211","sha":"67c6c4695759ae69647d892c7b268a8969334211","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/67c6c4695759ae69647d892c7b268a8969334211"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/63b6d016d4dbc8b936d79554d7dd9fe4c83cf49b","sha":"63b6d016d4dbc8b936d79554d7dd9fe4c83cf49b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/63b6d016d4dbc8b936d79554d7dd9fe4c83cf49b"}],"sha":"2c9de494d487762662f8e7ad37eaa62f92371db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/2c9de494d487762662f8e7ad37eaa62f92371db1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzIyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/63b6d016d4dbc8b936d79554d7dd9fe4c83cf49b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T18:41:06Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T18:41:06Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"message":"Move the test toolchain to jest 30\n\njest, jest-environment-jsdom and @types/jest to 30; ts-jest stays at\n29.4.12, which is its latest and declares jest 29 or 30 as a peer.\n\nOne test needed changing. jsdom 30 makes `window.location`\nnon-configurable, as a real browser does, so the `Object.defineProperty`\nin the console dialog''s setup now throws and took all 23 tests in that\nfile with it. It was there to steer the default in\n\n  socketUrl(ticket, location = window.location)\n\nwhich is already injectable, so the honest fix is to tell jsdom what URL\nthe page is on rather than to overwrite the object afterwards:\n\n  @jest-environment-options {\"url\": \"http://boat.local:3000\"}\n\nThat is the only site in the suite redefining a window property, and the\ndocblock works on jest 29 as well — the suite is green on both, so this\nis not a change the version bump forced through.\n\nNothing else moved: 1089 tests pass, coverage is unchanged at 91%\nstatements against an 80% threshold, and tsc, eslint, prettier and the\nbuild are clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K9fDtyuD5qoERSx31HHEbd","tree":{"sha":"d1577ed42e1bcaac4fc6a57b696d13e018ff18af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/trees/d1577ed42e1bcaac4fc6a57b696d13e018ff18af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/commits/63b6d016d4dbc8b936d79554d7dd9fe4c83cf49b","verification":{"payload":"tree d1577ed42e1bcaac4fc6a57b696d13e018ff18af\nparent 67c6c4695759ae69647d892c7b268a8969334211\nauthor KEGustafsson <ke.gustafsson@gmail.com> 1789238466 +0000\ncommitter KEGustafsson <ke.gustafsson@gmail.com> 1789238466 +0000\n\nMove the test toolchain to jest 30\n\njest, jest-environment-jsdom and @types/jest to 30; ts-jest stays at\n29.4.12, which is its latest and declares jest 29 or 30 as a peer.\n\nOne test needed changing. jsdom 30 makes `window.location`\nnon-configurable, as a real browser does, so the `Object.defineProperty`\nin the console dialog''s setup now throws and took all 23 tests in that\nfile with it. It was there to steer the default in\n\n  socketUrl(ticket, location = window.location)\n\nwhich is already injectable, so the honest fix is to tell jsdom what URL\nthe page is on rather than to overwrite the object afterwards:\n\n  @jest-environment-options {\"url\": \"http://boat.local:3000\"}\n\nThat is the only site in the suite redefining a window property, and the\ndocblock works on jest 29 as well — the suite is green on both, so this\nis not a change the version bump forced through.\n\nNothing else moved: 1089 tests pass, coverage is unchanged at 91%\nstatements against an 80% threshold, and tsc, eslint, prettier and the\nbuild are clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K9fDtyuD5qoERSx31HHEbd\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQErgT/Pe\nRdSGOHuInBbIkw5ULGgYCBp5b0nqVL93ZMwMI4m2xkFRAh4Qq11q+VQYVr3xvpvPWioNzZqeRZaY\nLwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlc