rred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/63ebc2cdd03eaf08cb3001b2b29a66a579086876","node_id":"C_kwDOR829YtoAKDYzZWJjMmNkZDAzZWFmMDhjYjMwMDFiMmIyOWE2NmE1NzkwODY4NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/c0f52561dbf8bf4874bf2ca339a5960310c074a0","sha":"c0f52561dbf8bf4874bf2ca339a5960310c074a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/c0f52561dbf8bf4874bf2ca339a5960310c074a0"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/550d460008fdf96a17985a03561397cc21a277c0","sha":"550d460008fdf96a17985a03561397cc21a277c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/550d460008fdf96a17985a03561397cc21a277c0"}],"sha":"63ebc2cdd03eaf08cb3001b2b29a66a579086876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/63ebc2cdd03eaf08cb3001b2b29a66a579086876"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzIyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/550d460008fdf96a17985a03561397cc21a277c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:56:22Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:56:22Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"message":"Stop the plugin the same way in every test\n\nFour of the twenty-five stop calls were written `void instance.stop()` rather\nthan awaited, for no reason a reader could infer from the test: their `it`\ncallbacks happened to be synchronous, so `await` was not available and the\nresult had to be discarded instead.\n\nThe review read the implementation — `stop(): void` — and asked for plain calls\nthroughout. The type the tests are written against is the server API''s\n`stop(): void | Promise<void>`, declared that way for plugins whose teardown is\nasynchronous, so a bare call is a floating promise and now fails the lint run.\nAwaiting is also what these tests want if this plugin''s teardown ever becomes\none of those: they assert on what stopping did, and would otherwise race it.\n\nSo the four callbacks are async and every stop is awaited.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7265fd3696efa9eb4df911e56ed92105c91ce362","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/trees/7265fd3696efa9eb4df911e56ed92105c91ce362"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/commits/550d460008fdf96a17985a03561397cc21a277c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzIyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/550d460008fdf96a17985a03561397cc21a277c0","node_id":"C_kwDOR829YtoAKDU1MGQ0NjAwMDhmZGY5NmExNzk4NWEwMzU2MTM5N2NjMjFhMjc3YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/f86ebe619caa111dc1505665f4647f68cb751210","sha":"f86ebe619caa111dc1505665f4647f68cb751210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/f86ebe619caa111dc1505665f4647f68cb751210"}],"sha":"550d460008fdf96a17985a03561397cc21a277c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/550d460008fdf96a17985a03561397cc21a277c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzIyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/f86ebe619caa111dc1505665f4647f68cb751210/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:43:01Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:43:01Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"message":"Make the ten staged rules errors\n\nThey were set to ''warn'' so that turning the type-aware rules on would not fail\na build over 272 findings in code that predates them, with a note in each block\nsaying they would become errors once the backlog was cleared. It is cleared, so\nthey are errors like the rest of the checked set, and the next floating promise\nin the relay code fails the run instead of joining a list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b40fc3401d1ec4ca96ec26155e131585f603f852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/trees/b40fc3401d1ec4ca96ec26155e131585f603f852"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/commits/f86ebe619caa111dc1505665f4647f68cb751210","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzIyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/f86ebe619caa111dc1505665f4647f68cb751210","node_id":"C_kwDOR829YtoAKGY4NmViZTYxOWNhYTExMWRjMTUwNTY2NWY0NjQ3ZjY4Y2I3NTEyMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/235211e2b7b562f410866cfe5ca665d52b2386ac","sha":"235211e2b7b562f410866cfe5ca665d52b2386ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/235211e2b7b562f410866cfe5ca665d52b2386ac"}],"sha":"f86ebe619caa111dc1505665f4647f68cb751210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/f86ebe619caa111dc1505665f4647f68cb751210"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzIyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/235211e2b7b562f410866cfe5ca665d52b2386ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:43:01Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:43:01Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"message":"Type what the tests read back, so their assertions are checked\n\n245 of the backlog''s findings were in the suite, and nearly all of them were\ntwo `any`s spreading from the same two places.\n\nsupertest types `res.body` as `any`, so every `expect(res.body.error)` was an\nassertion nothing checked. `asJson` in the support module reads a body as a\nJSON shape instead — loose enough for a fixture, and specifically not `any` —\nwith a declared shape at the sites that index into one.\n\n`jest.fn()` is a `jest.Mock<any, any>`, which matters more: `mock.calls[0]?.[0]`\nis where these tests assert what the panel actually requested, and against `any`\nthey would have gone on passing through a changed URL or a dropped method. A\ntyped `FetchMock` in test/webapp/mocks.ts gives those calls a signature, and\n`jsonBody` reads a request body without stringifying a `BodyInit` union that\ncould have been a Blob. `asResponse` says once that a fixture carrying `ok`,\n`status` and `json` is deliberately not the other twelve members of Response.\n\nThe 70 mocks declared `async` with nothing to await now return a promise the\nway a mock should — `() => Promise.resolve(x)`, and `Promise.reject(new Error())`\nfor the three that stood in for an unreadable body. `Plugin.stop` is declared\n`void | Promise<void>` by the server API, so the tests await it.\n\nTwo `eslint-disable` comments are left, both on `async function*` fixtures:\n`AsyncGenerator<LogFrame>` has no synchronous form and those frames come from\nmemory. Each carries its reason.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4cbfbd0f4d40202b7942ba546b819862f16a747a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/trees/4cbfbd0f4d40202b7942ba546b819862f16a747a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/commits/235211e2b7b562f410866cfe5ca665d52b2386ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzIyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/235211e2b7b562f410866cfe5ca665d52b2386ac","node_id":"C_kwDOR829YtoAKDIzNTIxMWUyYjdiNTYyZjQxMDg2NmNmZTVjYTY2NWQ1MmIyMzg2YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/48cb308926c2dc5979518aed9cf8c3f4483b87b1","sha":"48cb308926c2dc5979518aed9cf8c3f4483b87b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/48cb308926c2dc5979518aed9cf8c3f4483b87b1"}],"sha":"235211e2b7b562f410866cfe5ca665d52b2386ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/235211e2b7b562f410866cfe5ca665d52b2386ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzIyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/48cb308926c2dc5979518aed9cf8c3f4483b87b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:42:47Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:42:47Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"message":"Give the router a synchronous handler, and drop three dead assertions\n\nExpress 4 does nothing with a promise a route handler returns. Every route in\nthe facade was an `async` function handed straight to it, so a rejection would\nhave been an unhandled rejection rather than a reply — 25 of the 28 findings\nthe type-aware rules had in src/, all of them the same mistake made once in\n`handle` and inherited by every route through it.\n\nNothing has ever escaped that way: `handle` already caught everything it could\nname and answered in every branch. So the wrapper is not a bug fix but the\nclosing of the gap the rules point at — the async work is now `respond`, and\nwhat the router gets is a synchronous function that starts it and keeps hold of\nthe failure. Reaching that catch means the response itself failed, which is\nlogged as unanswered because there is nowhere left to send a status.\n\nBoth handler types now accept a plain payload as well as a promise for one:\n`/api/instances` and `/api/control` read what the plugin already has in memory\nand await nothing, and saying so is what lets them stop being `async`.\n\nThe three type assertions removed alongside them are ones the compiler agrees\nwere doing nothing, and `redactValue` reads an array back as `unknown[]` rather\nthan the `any[]` that `Array.isArray` narrows a generic to.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffcb595335ced30a43284557f7692c624766bf65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/trees/ffcb595335ced30a43284557f7692c624766bf65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/commits/48cb308926c2dc5979518aed9cf8c3f4483b87b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM