ff58c4e3ba1edb89fe77d8663094e023b3475/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:34:18Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:34:18Z","email":"ke.gustafsson@gmail.com","name":"KEGustafsson"},"message":"Point the App Store at two screenshots\n\nThe package tells the App Store its name and icon but shows nothing of what it\ndoes. A `signalk.screenshots` array now carries the two images that answer that\nfastest: the Containers tab, which is the panel someone installs this for, and\nthe configuration page, which is what they meet first.\n\nThe URLs are raw.githubusercontent links on `main` rather than package-relative\npaths, because `docs/` is excluded from the tarball and these twelve images have\nno reason to be in it. Whether the server reads this field is unconfirmed — it\nappears nowhere in `@signalk/server-api` — so the shape is a guess at a sensible\none, and costs nothing if nothing reads it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d34e43f22b06150cd09da2fb65b82733a2a91b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/trees/2d34e43f22b06150cd09da2fb65b82733a2a91b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/commits/242ff58c4e3ba1edb89fe77d8663094e023b3475","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3332251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KEGustafsson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson","id":3332251,"login":"KEGustafsson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzIyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.g