nThe panel changed under this branch: it opens on Environments and the choice is\nmade by pressing a row rather than from a dropdown, the header names the\nenvironment instead of offering it, and the configuration form is one address\nfield with an Advanced block behind it. Every image is retaken against that\nbuild, so none of them shows a control that no longer exists.\n\nThe fixture grows an edge environment that is not checking in, so the\nEnvironments shot has something for the Health column to say — and so the\nscreenshot exercises the heartbeat reading main added rather than two rows of\n\"up\".\n\nThe images are placed into the rewritten README where it already explains each\nthing: the panel under Using the panel, section by section, the form beside the\nsteps that fill it in, and the data browser beside the delta paths it publishes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NWDUpnG54LrxgomuLgHJNQ","tree":{"sha":"2dced25478b1ded92b2adf0a4e93a2656b153f21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/trees/2dced25478b1ded92b2adf0a4e93a2656b153f21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/commits/b987135a2eca3a39bf703a39878a44e68a092f30","verification":{"payload":"tree 2dced25478b1ded92b2adf0a4e93a2656b153f21\nparent 3463d4bdabfa09c54703b0624a5c1d560ccfbe2d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787485161 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787485161 +0000\n\nRetake the screenshots against the panel main now has\n\nThe panel changed under this branch: it opens on Environments and the choice is\nmade by pressing a row rather than from a dropdown, the header names the\nenvironment instead of offering it, and the configuration form is one address\nfield with an Advanced block behind it. Every image is retaken against that\nbuild, so none of them shows a control that no longer exists.\n\nThe fixture grows an edge environment that 