laude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commits/3adea03d823e20d364bc06cac2c54141274aefa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T10:57:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T10:57:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: rewrite README as user documentation\n\nDrop the milestone status banner, the \"What works today\" framing and the\n\"What has and has not been verified\" section, and trim the design rationale\nthat belongs in docs/plan.md. Restructure what remains around what the\nplugin is and how to use it: requirements, installing, configuration, using\nthe panel, Signal K integration, the REST API, safety guards, development.\n\nUpdate the CHANGELOG note that linked the removed README section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QYuPnEdKTP4LeStH686na1","tree":{"sha":"2813018361014fcbaa74e6fdaea9f963a4305ad2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/trees/2813018361014fcbaa74e6fdaea9f963a4305ad2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/git/commits/3adea03d823e20d364bc06cac2c54141274aefa7","verification":{"payload":"tree 2813018361014fcbaa74e6fdaea9f963a4305ad2\nparent 8fcf6ea6b4837fab980a9354e51bdcffa8242659\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787482678 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787482678 +0000\n\ndocs: rewrite README as user documentation\n\nDrop the milestone status banner, the \"What works today\" framing and the\n\"What has and has not been verified\" section, and trim the design rationale\nthat belongs in docs/plan.md. Restructure what remains around what the\nplugin is and how to use it: requirements, installing, configuration, using\nthe panel, Signal K integration, the REST API, safety guards, development.\n\nUpdate the CHANGELOG note that linked the removed README section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QYuPnEdKTP4LeStH686na1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ4W+md1\nJCtdvflEtDPVf2C8Go7m4w3VBa9Xybzr8+fhqGbN7597QflIODIK8p3j/obE2uQQFAqKW2La39Lk\nQwc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-23T10:58:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KEGustafsson/signalk-portainer/commit/3adea03d823e20d364bc06cac2c54141274aefa7","node_id":"C_kwDOR829YtoAKDNhZGVhMDNkODIzZTIwZDM2NGJ