:"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/897ec0989442c152558719c865f9cc0b33b0b688/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T02:38:12Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T02:38:12Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"message":"Reframe PWA section as ''PWA Runtime Assertions''\n\nThe previous ''PWA Tests'' framing implied PWA was a parallel testing\ntechnology peer to UI/API/GraphQL. It isn''t — PWA tests run on the\nsame page fixture as UI tests, only the assertions are different\n(manifest validity, service worker registration, cache storage,\noffline behaviour). Rename the section and add a one-paragraph\nexplanation of what these assertions verify and why a normal UI test\nwon''t catch them. Update TOC, npm script comment, and tag table for\nconsistency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b25b4a891e6f7b3d8ee613af77df0883701b2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/trees/2b25b4a891e6f7b3d8ee613af77df0883701b2d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/commits/897ec0989442c152558719c865f9cc0b33b0b688","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/897ec0989442c152558719c865f9cc0b33b0b688","node_id":"C_kwDOR9Wx_toAKDg5N2VjMDk4OTQ0MmMxNTI1NTg3MTljODY1ZjljYzBiMzNiMGI2ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/148eae4cb4436da19d0e4e575fb9ec87045df5f1","sha":"148eae4cb4436da19d0e4e575fb9ec87045df5f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/148eae4cb4436da19d0e4e575fb9ec87045df5f1"}],"sha":"897ec0989442c152558719c865f9cc0b33b0b688","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/897ec0989442c152558719c865f9cc0b33b0b688"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/148eae4cb4436da19d0e4e575fb9ec87045df5f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T17:09:04Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T17:09:04Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"message":"Fix allure-playwright option name so results land where docs claim\n\nThe allure-playwright reporter silently ignored `outputFolder` because\nthe v3+ option is `resultsDir`. As a result, every test run wrote\nresults to ./allure-results at the repo root (the package''s default)\ninstead of reports/allure-results. The downstream symptom was that\n`npm run report:allure` generated an empty report because it pointed\nat reports/allure-results which never got populated.\n\nRenaming the reporter option to `resultsDir` makes results land in\nreports/allure-results as intended, and npm run report:allure starts\nproducing real reports end-to-end with no other changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"733cfce3c438e89336bac924be4308389b88e88b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/trees/733cfce3c438e89336bac924be4308389b88e88b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/commits/148eae4cb4436da19d0e4e575fb9ec87045df5f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/148eae4cb4436da19d0e4e575fb9ec87045df5f1","node_id":"C_kwDOR9Wx_toAKDE0OGVhZTRjYjQ0MzZkYTE5ZDBlNGU1NzVmYjllYzg3MDQ1ZGY1ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/463fb51c5e058fe9af853380b69d4ff232c3f011","sha":"463fb51c5e058fe9af853380b69d4ff232c3f011","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/463fb51c5e058fe9af853380b69d4ff232c3f011"}],"sha":"148eae4cb4436da19d0e4e575fb9ec87045df5f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/148eae4cb4436da19d0e4e575fb9ec87045df5f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/463fb51c5e058fe9af853380b69d4ff232c3f011/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T17:03:26Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T17:03:26Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"message":"Architect-review cleanup: drop dead code, harden Docker, tighten docs\n\nActs on the senior-architect audit findings. All items are fixes, not\nnew features.\n\n- Drop xlsx dependency entirely. The package has known prototype-\n  pollution CVEs and the framework''s own Limitations section already\n  claimed it was unsupported — but package.json shipped xlsx, the data\n  loader had readExcelData, and the README data-source table listed\n  Excel. All three are now consistent: no dep, no function, no docs.\n- Delete auth/ dead directory. global-setup.ts auth-state recipe now\n  references .auth/storage-state.json (created on demand).\n- Delete execute-tests.js and execute-graphql-tests.js. They were thin\n  argv wrappers that ran the same command as `npx playwright test\n  tests/api/ --project=X` with no added value. Package scripts and\n  README section removed too.\n- Delete unused barrel exports (core/index.ts, utils/index.ts,\n  services/index.ts, config/index.ts). Zero specs imported from them —\n  they were documentation that lied about the actual import surface.\n- Upgrade auto-healer to attach healing events as both JSON (for\n  dashboards and the roadmap centralized healing store) and a plain-\n  text summary (for eyeballing during debugging).\n- Harden Dockerfile: two-stage build (deps → runtime), runs as\n  non-root pwuser, new .dockerignore excludes node_modules, reports,\n  test artefacts, local env, and editor clutter.\n- Add browser matrix to run-tests.yml: pull_request runs chrome,\n  firefox, and webkit in parallel so Firefox/WebKit regressions are\n  caught at PR time instead of the next morning. Manual\n  workflow_dispatch still honours the single-browser input.\n- Document the intentional locators/ vs test-data/ asymmetry in\n  CLAUDE.md: locators are code-adjacent (1:1 with page objects), test\n  fixtures/datasets/i18n are test inputs.\n- Fix stale test-data/locators/ references in README and\n  ENTERPRISE-ADOPTION-GUIDE.md (locators moved to repo root earlier;\n  docs were still pointing at the old path).\n\nNet: 351 deletions, 79 insertions. Typecheck clean, smoke suite\npasses on chrome, lifecycle demo hooks fire in correct order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a9a3401e15c0719c3ca520467f6ed47e1b0ca53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/trees/3a9a3401e15c0719c3ca520467f6ed47e1b0ca53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/commits/463fb51c5e058fe9af853380b69d4ff232c3f011","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/463fb51c5e058fe9af853380b69d4ff232c3f011","node_id":"C_kwDOR9Wx_toAKDQ2M2ZiNTFjNWUwNThmZTlhZjg1MzM4MGI2OWQ0ZmYyMzJjM2YwMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/ed37bbebd72ea9ba623f4d414486895a86aa6bee","sha":"ed37bbebd72ea9ba623f4d414486895a86aa6bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/ed37bbebd72ea9ba623f4d414486895a86aa6bee"}],"sha":"463fb51c5e058fe9af853380b69d4ff232c3f011","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/463fb51c5e058fe9af853380b69d4ff232c3f011"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/ed37bbebd72ea9ba623f4d414486895a86aa6bee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T16:18:24Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T16:18:24Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"message":"Split Limitations into Roadmap and Limitations sections\n\nReclassify items that are future enhancements (visual regression, DB\nadapter pack, advanced Vault auth, centralized healing store,\ndistributed shared state, publishable npm package) under a new Roadmap\nsection with current state / why / value / path forward for each.\n\nKeep genuine architectural and external-constraint boundaries (web\nonly, functional vs load, TypeScript only, Playwright engine, Allure\nJVM requirement, Google Sheets service account, Excel CVE, AWS peer\ndep) under a tightened Limitations section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"abcce903fab46210ee0268db53f87cd466636ae9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/trees/abcce903fab46210ee0268db53f87cd466636ae9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/commits/ed37bbebd72ea9ba623f4d414486895a86aa6bee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/ed37bbebd72ea9ba623f4d414486895a86aa6bee","node_id":"C_kwDOR9Wx_toAKGVkMzdiYmViZDcyZWE5YmE2MjNmNGQ0MTQ0ODY4OTVhODZhYTZiZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/e6675fea6e21832f7d79277fbbfadd89382048f4","sha":"e6675fea6e21832f7d79277fbbfadd89382048f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/e6675fea6e21832f7d79277fbbfadd89382048f4"}],"sha":"ed37bbebd72ea9ba623f4d414486895a86aa6bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/ed37bbebd72ea9ba623f4d414486895a86aa6bee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/e6675fea6e21832f7d79277fbbfadd89382048f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T16:10:11Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T16:10:11Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"message":"Enable lifecycle hooks and document setup/teardown story\n\n- playwright.config.ts: enable globalSetup / globalTeardown (previously\n  scaffolded but commented out).\n- global-setup.ts: env validation + run-wide file lock (.playwright-run.lock)\n  active by default; auth-state capture and DB migration recipes included\n  as commented examples.\n- global-teardown.ts: releases the file lock; includes commented recipes\n  for shared-state cleanup, results upload, and Slack notification.\n- fixtures/base-fixtures.ts: add worker-scoped dbConnection fixture\n  (stub client, clearly marked for replacement with a real DB client)\n  so customers have a copy-pasteable template for long-lived resources.\n  Wire reportHealing() into loginPage/inventoryPage fixture teardowns so\n  the auto-healing log is actually attached to every test report.\n- tests/ui/lifecycle-demo.spec.ts: new runnable reference showing\n  beforeAll/beforeEach/afterEach/afterAll order against real SauceDemo\n  pages, tagged @lifecycle.\n- README.md: new \"Test Lifecycle & Setup/Teardown\" section with a\n  five-layer table (global / worker / fixture / beforeAll / beforeEach),\n  decision tree for picking the right layer, and a list of the cleanups\n  Playwright already handles so engineers don''t duplicate them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58942cf749355b4d144aee3c78827c8ccfe759be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/trees/58942cf749355b4d144aee3c78827c8ccfe759be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/commits/e6675fea6e21832f7d79277fbbfadd89382048f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/e6675fea6e21832f7d79277fbbfadd89382048f4","node_id":"C_kwDOR9Wx_toAKGU2Njc1ZmVhNmUyMTgzMmY3ZDc5Mjc3ZmJiZmFkZDg5MzgyMDQ4ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/4cd9e49b2734605702342b609fd40604225d2f12","sha":"4cd9e49b2734605702342b609fd40604225d2f12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/4cd9e49b2734605702342b609fd40604225d2f12"}],"sha":"e6675fea6e21832f7d79277fbbfadd89382048f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/e6675fea6e21832f7d79277fbbfadd89382048f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/4cd9e49b2734605702342b609fd40604225d2f12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T15:04:50Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T15:04:50Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"message":"Move locators to root, redesign SmartLocatorEngine for real auto-healing\n\n- Promote locators/ to a top-level folder; rename files to mirror page\n  objects (login.page.ts <-> login.locators.json) for discoverability.\n- Make testIdAttribute a single source of truth in\n  locator-strategy.config.ts; playwright.config.ts now reads it into\n  use.testIdAttribute so the runtime and engine cannot drift.\n- Redesign SmartLocatorEngine around Playwright Locators:\n    * buildLocator(name)        — sync, returns primary.or(fallback) chain\n    * resolveWithHealing(name)  — async, probes primary then walks\n                                  fallbacks, logs HealingEvent on heal\n  Removes the dead get()/getWithFallback()/resolveToCSS() paths that\n  caused silent semantic-prefix bugs and made auto-healing unreachable.\n- BasePage interactions now route through resolveWithHealing so the\n  healing log captures real fallback usage; queries and waits use\n  buildLocator''s .or() chain for resilience without per-call probing.\n- Update locator JSONs and inventory.page.ts inventoryItems getter to\n  the new API; auto-healer path corrected to locators/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56334e46f756f6245973097b701449430c848f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/trees/56334e46f756f6245973097b701449430c848f05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/commits/4cd9e49b2734605702342b609fd40604225d2f12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/4cd9e49b2734605702342b609fd40604225d2f12","node_id":"C_kwDOR9Wx_toAKDRjZDllNDliMjczNDYwNTcwMjM0MmI2MDlmZDQwNjA0MjI1ZDJmMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commit/6d7a1048cc8ee9e63b67bcac6171dad7d806eb85","sha":"6d7a1048cc8ee9e63b67bcac6171dad7d806eb85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/6d7a1048cc8ee9e63b67bcac6171dad7d806eb85"}],"sha":"4cd9e49b2734605702342b609fd40604225d2f12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/4cd9e49b2734605702342b609fd40604225d2f12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113003078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sreevsr","id":113003078,"login":"sreevsr","node_id":"U_kgDOBrxKRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sreevsr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/commits/6d7a1048cc8ee9e63b67bcac6171dad7d806eb85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T18:09:02Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T18:09:02Z","email":"srinidhi.ts@gmail.com","name":"srinidhi sreevatsa"},"message":"Initial commit — Enterprise Playwright Automation Framework\n\nFull-featured, TypeScript-first test automation framework covering\nUI, REST API, GraphQL, Accessibility (WCAG), i18n, and PWA testing\nwith cross-browser support, parallel execution, auto-healing locators,\nand CI/CD integration (GitHub Actions, Jenkins, Azure DevOps, Docker/AWS).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da3b3b7f9ef9a57c7055220ff2d4ebae4b81ee9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/playwright-framework/git/trees/da3b3b7f9ef9a57c7055220ff2d4ebae4b81ee9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sreevsr/